    "date_str": "2026-11-02",
    "description": "Bird\u2019s-eye view: Economy stable and growing. Worm\u2019s-eye view: Not so rosy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Bird-s-eye-view-Economy-stable-and-growing-Worm-s-eye-view-Not-so-rosy/4-799474",
