    "md5": "5641f0e9e3813a8f2254d1e0dab1918e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 607,
    "chunk_text": "During the inspection, police recovered a motorcycle ignition key, a protective talisman (Suraya), several bone fragments and a burnt piece of tent fabric suspected to have been used to transport the victim's body. These items were taken into police custody as evidence.\n\nThe facts uncovered during the investigation were also reported to the Colombo Chief Magistrate's Court. All four suspects have been remanded until November 2, 2026.\n\nThe suspects, aged 29, 32, 37 and 46, are residents of Wellampitiya and Agalawatta.\n\nThe Colombo Crimes Division is conducting further investigations into the incident."
