    "chunk_text": "Jailer 2 overtook 2.0's worldwide total of Rs 691 crore during its second weekend. By Day 17, it stood at Rs 790.85 crore worldwide, including an estimated Rs 270.50 crore from overseas. That's well above 2.0's overseas haul of Rs 172 crore.\n\nDirected by Nelson Dilipkumar, Jailer 2 is a Tamil action drama with Rajinikanth returning as retired jailer Tiger Muthuvel Pandian. Ramya Krishnan, Yogi Babu, Vinayakan, Vidya Balan, Jackie Shroff, Mohanlal, Shivarajkumar, Vijay Sethupathi and Hrithik Roshan are also part of the film. It hit theatres on October 15, 2026, in Tamil, Hindi, Kannada and Telugu."
