    "chunk_text": "\"My thoughts are with the families of those who have lost their lives, everyone injured and all those affected by this senseless violence. The United Kingdom stands in solidarity with the people of Poland,\" he added.\n\nFootage showed the attacker's vehicle speeding through the centre of the city, and people fleeing as the sound of gunfire rang out.\n\nThe glass front of shops were shattered by bullets and a tram was shot at during the attack, which police say lasted for around three minutes.\n\nImages from the scene show overturned tables and scattered belongings left behind as people ran for their lives.\n\nArmed police officers pursued the attacker's car until it crashed, at which point they engaged him in a firefight.\n\nDistressing footage authenticated by BBC Verify captured the moment a police officer confronted the suspect as he lay on the ground.\n\nThe officer, who is visibly injured, can then be seen falling to the ground."
