    "chunk_text": "Businessman dies after fall from Slave Island apartment complex\n\nColombo, Nov 08 (Daily Mirror) - A 59-year-old businessman died after falling from an apartment complex in Kompannavidiya (Slave Island) this morning (08), Police said.\n\nThe incident occurred at around 10.55 am, with the deceased identified as a resident of Battaramulla.\n\nPolice have launched an investigation to determine whether the man accidentally fell from the building or died by suicide.\n\nThe Kompannavidiya Police are conducting further investigations into the incident."
