    "chunk_text": "Launched earlier this year, Dialog Pay brings together a comprehensive range of everyday financial transactions through the MyDialog platform and the dedicated Dialog Pay App. Customers can make QR payments, pay bills, transfer money, link bank accounts, access GovPay services and selected financial services through a single digital platform. In a short span of time, Dialog Pay has expanded its QR payment acceptance footprint to more than 100,000 outlets across Sri Lanka, enabling seamless digital transactions for customers while helping merchants participate more actively in the country\u2019s growing digital payments landscape.\n\nThe award reinforces Dialog\u2019s continued commitment to advancing digital innovation through solutions that make everyday transactions simpler and more convenient for Sri Lankan consumers and businesses. Users can explore Dialog Pay and its features through the MyDialog platform, the Dialog Pay App and dialog.lk/dialog-pay."
