    "chunk_text": "Dialog Pay Wins Gold for Best Digital Payments Innovation at Sri Lanka FinTech Awards 2026\n\nFrom left to right: Tuan P. Shiraz, Senior Data Analyst, Dialog Axiata PLC; Madavika Munasinghe, Data Analyst, Dialog Axiata PLC; Tharindu Karunarathne, Senior Brand Manager, Dialog Axiata PLC; Kiythmaa Cooray, Brand Manager, Dialog Axiata PLC; Aaqib Reyal, Head of Brands, Strategy, Services & Masterbrand, Dialog Axiata PLC; Shantha Fernando, Head of Marketing and Business Performance, Dialog Axiata PLC; Lasantha Theverapperuma, Group Chief Marketing Officer, Dialog Axiata PLC; Tharaka Madusanka, Senior Product Manager, Dialog Axiata PLC; Muditha Premarathne, Vice President, Digital Platforms and Partnerships, Dialog Axiata PLC; Uresh Duminduwardena, Vice President, Digital Technology, Dialog Axiata PLC; Nadee Tennakoon, Delivery Excellence Manager, Dialog Axiata PLC; Nadeesh Nanayakkara, Head of Super App Operations, Dialog Axiata PLC; Jathu Sivapathasundram, Head, Digital Marketing, Dialog Axiata PLC\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, won the Gold Award for Best Digital Payments Innovation at the Sri Lanka FinTech Awards 2026, recognising Dialog Pay\u2019s contribution to strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s national digital payments ecosystem by making secure, convenient and accessible digital transactions available to consumers and businesses across the country."
