    "description": "Scientists predict 2026 hottest year on record as climate talks begin",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Scientists-predict-2026-hottest-year-on-record-as-climate-talks-begin/107-354499",
    "lang": "en",
