    "description": "Sri Lankan University Rankings: The free fall (Part 2)",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lankan-University-Rankings-The-free-fall-Part-2/4-799837",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
