    "chunk_text": "Lorry swept away by floods found trapped in tree\n\nColombo, Nov. 10 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0A lorry swept away by flash floods following the overflow of the Hatton Oya was found trapped in a tree along the riverbank early this morning (10), according to the vehicle's owner.\n\nThe incident occurred yesterday afternoon (09) following heavy rainfall in the Hatton area, which caused the Hatton Oya, a major tributary of the Mahaweli River, to swell and sweep away the lorry parked in the area.\n\nMeanwhile, the overflow of the Hatton Oya flooded nearly 50 houses in low-lying areas surrounding Rothes, affected residents said."
