    "md5": "fcd639712efa80d7a496e9267d9a5da2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 944,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank facilitates digitalization of CP stamp duty payment process\n\nIn line with government\u2019s National Digital Economy Strategy 2025\u20132030, People\u2019s Bank has extended digital banking facilities to support the Central Provincial Revenue Department in digitalizing the stamp duty payment process, marking an important step towards modernizing public revenue collection services.\n\nThe digitalized process was officially inaugurated by the Governor of the Central Province, Dr. Harsha Suranga Fernando.\n\nThe occasion was attended by Central Provincial Chief Secretary H.G.M.A. Premasinghe, Central Provincial Revenue Commissioner K.G.P.J. Katupulla, and representatives of People\u2019s Bank, including Assistant Regional Manager S.B.S.K. Priyadarshana and Chief Manager of Kandy Branch Prasanna Karunarathne. Officials from the Digitalization Department, Revenue Department and Central Provincial Council were also present at the event."
