    "chunk_text": "The keynote will be delivered by Biswajit Das, Head \u2013 Specialist Sales \u2013 AI & GTM, India and South Asia, Amazon Web Services. Parallel industry sessions will explore AI applications in banking and finance for forecasting and risk management; healthcare and life sciences for diagnosis, treatment and prevention; and manufacturing and supply chains for demand forecasting and inventory management.\n\nContributors to the programme include VidyaJyothi Professor Vajira H. W. Dissanayake\u00a0 - Chair and Senior Professor of Anatomy, Genetics and Biomedical Informatics; Dr. Rukshan Batuwita Staff Research Engineer \u2013 Google; Dr. Malith Jayasinghe- Vice President AI - WSO2; Moumita Sarker - Founder and CEO of Illuminati Consulting.ai; Ashwini Natesan - Legal consultant and research fellow specializing in Technology, Media & Telecommunications; Jayantha Fernando - Senior Consultant Tech-Law & Privacy and\u00a0 TMT Partner at Heritage; Asela Waidyalankara - Senior Consultant Tech-Law & Privacy & TMT Partner at Heritage; Mark Surgenor - Chief Executive Officer HSBC Sri Lanka & Maldives; Mahesha Amarasuriya - Country Head - Mastercard Sri Lanka; Dr. Dhanushi Hettiarachchi - Founder and CEO OPHTHA Innovations; Dr. Ruvan Weerasinghe - Academic and Researcher in AI and NLP; Shanil Fernando - Co-Founder and Chief Technology and AI Officer Cut & Dry; Dehan Vithana - Lead Data Evangelist MAS, Moderator; Devmin Jayawardena - Senior Manager Data Science and AI Lead at Grant Thornton Stax; Harshan Senadheera - Chief Manager Organizational Transformation -\u00a0 Sampath Bank PLC; Sithira Wanniarachchi - Group Chief Information Security Officer, JXG (Janashakthi Group) and Dumindu Tennakoon - Country Manager - Sri Lanka for Redington.\n\nDr. Sanjiva Weerawarana will deliver the closing keynote, \u201cThe Next Frontier \u2013 What to Expect in 2027\u201d, examining emerging trends, digital resource ownership and future-proofing AI investments."
