    "chunk_text": "Speaking at the launch, Sampath Bank Deputy General Manager Consumer and SME Banking Asanka Liayanage said, \u201cSampath Sevana 360 Hub reflects our commitment to making home ownership a more straightforward experience. Buying or building a home is a significant milestone and the financing process should support that ambition rather than add to its difficulty. Our aim is to bring the entire journey together through a single point of contact, greater transparency and more efficient processing, with a targeted 10-working-day approval timeline, subject to complete documentation and applicable approval requirements.\u201d\n\nA dedicated relationship officer will guide each customer throughout the process, eliminating the need to navigate multiple departments and coordinate separately with bank officers, lawyers and property valuers. The services will cover application acceptance, document verification, legal coordination, property valuation, credit processing, customer progress updates and loan disbursement.\n\nThe Borella Super Branch will serve as the initial location for Sampath Sevana 360 Hub, introducing a dedicated housing finance experience that brings convenience, coordination and a clearer path towards homeownership under one roof."
