    "chunk_text": "DFCC Bank relocates Peradeniya branch\n\nNew, more spacious premises strengthen access to personal and business banking services across the greater Kandy region\n\nDFCC Bank has relocated its Peradeniya branch to No. 554, Peradeniya Road, Kandy, providing the customers with a more spacious and convenient environment in which to access personal and business banking services.\n\nThe relocated branch will continue to serve individuals, professionals, entrepreneurs and businesses from Peradeniya and the wider Kandy region.\n\nThe new premises enable the branch team to assist the customers across a range of banking requirements, including everyday banking, savings, lending and business banking solutions. The customers can also receive financial guidance suited to their personal goals or business requirements while continuing to use DFCC Bank\u2019s digital channels for greater flexibility in managing their finances.\n\nPeradeniya serves a diverse community shaped by residential neighbourhoods, educational institutions, commercial activity and enterprise. Maintaining a strong presence in the area allows DFCC Bank to remain close to the people and businesses contributing to the region\u2019s continuing development.\n\nThe relocation forms part of DFCC Bank\u2019s wider effort to improve its customer touchpoints and make banking more convenient across its branch network.\n\nDFCC Bank welcomes the existing and new customers to its relocated Peradeniya branch."
