    "md5": "01ca2a3ef9ec8ef60fd18ed32425b7d8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1652,
    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank partners Kedalla Construction Expo 2026\n\nSeylan Bank has joined hands with Kedalla Construction Expo 2026 as its Title & Official Banking Partner for the 15th consecutive year.\n\nRecognised as the largest lifestyle exhibition in the country, the Expo will be held at the BMICH from 13th to 15th November, bringing homemakers face to face with the products and services needed to build, furnish and refresh a home.\n\nVisitors to the Seylan Bank stall will find the home financing journey made simpler. The Bank\u2019s \u2018Home Loan Specialists\u2019 will be on hand to guide customers through every stage, from completing the loan application to the final granting of the facility, at a competitive interest rate.\n\nVisitors to the Seylan Bank stall during the Expo can enjoy a range of exclusive benefits, starting with a free CRIB credit report for both existing and potential customers. They can also receive a free home loan evaluation, followed by on-the-spot approvals for eligible salaried customers. Seylan Home Loan Specialists will be available to provide end-to-end assistance throughout the process, while visitors can also benefit from a special discount on the processing fee.\n\nCommenting on the Bank\u2019s enduring association with the Expo, Eugene Seneviratne, Deputy General Manager \u2013 Retail Banking atSeylan Bank PLC said, \u201cReturning to Kedalla is a reflection of our partnership and the value it brings homebuyers, builders, and renovators by uniting them together under one roof, giving us the opportunity to meet them with financial solutions that are straightforward, supportive, and built around their plans for the future.\u201d"
  },
