    "chunk_text": "The Deputy Managing Director of CHEC Port City Colombo (Pvt) Ltd, Thulci Aluwihare, presented the investment opportunities offered by Port City Colombo, highlighting its status as Sri Lanka\u2019s only foreign currency-designated Special Economic Zone, with facilities including a single-window approval mechanism, 100% foreign ownership and transactions in 16 foreign currencies, including the Indian rupee.\n\nThe forum highlighted the potential for Indian businesses to leverage Sri Lanka\u2019s strategic location, investment framework and regional connectivity to expand their operations and access wider markets.\n\nThe event was coordinated by the First Secretary (Commercial) of the Deputy High Commission of Sri Lanka in Chennai, A.M. Heshani Kaushalya, under the guidance of the Deputy High Commissioner."
