    "chunk_text": "An alumnus of the Royal College, Wijayaratne possesses an impressive portfolio of academic qualifications and professional credentials. He holds a Master\u2019s Degree in Financial Economics from the University of Colombo and a Master of Business Administration (MBA) from the University of Manipal. He is a Senior Fellow of the Institute of Bankers of Sri Lanka (FIBs -SL) and a Fellow of the Institute of Chartered Professional Managers (FCPM). He also holds\u00a0 \u00a0membership of the Institute of Internal Auditors, USA (Sri Lankan Chapter). Beyond his distinguished career in banking and financial services, Wijayaratne possesses a strong grounding in economics and maintains professional memberships in both the Sri Lanka Economic Association and Institute of Quality and Productivity Management- Sri Lanka.\n\nIn conjunction with his corporate career, Wijayaratne has made a noteworthy contribution to professional education, knowledge and skills development. His academic engagements include lecturing at the College of Banking and Finance Studies of the Institute of Bankers of Sri Lanka and the Centre for Banking Studies of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka. He has also served as a visiting lecturer to graduate and postgraduate programs at several private universities and higher educational institutions, in addition to delivering lectures and professional development sessions at numerous institutions by invitation.\n\nHis commitment to professional service extends well beyond his corporate responsibilities. He has served the Association of Professional Bankers of Sri Lanka in several important leadership capacities, including Treasurer, Vice President and Senior Vice President, and currently serves on its Council of Advisors. He has also served as General Secretary and Chairman of the Association of Compliance Officers of Banks - Sri Lanka."
