    "chunk_text": "The Ministry of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education organised the all-island competition for the first time to assess students' commercial knowledge and entrepreneurial skills. The winning students received awards and certificates from the Prime Minister.\n\nA total of 100 centres are planned across the country in three phases from 2026 to 2028. The first phase, scheduled for this year, will establish 25 centres, covering all 25 districts.\n\nSeveral supplementary educational resources covering basic commerce-related subjects, along with a collection of modules introducing new teaching and learning methods, were also launched."
