    "description": "Good data required  when modelling  forecasts into the future - Dr. Thomas Adams -",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Good-data-required-when-modelling-forecasts-into-the-future-Dr-Thomas-Adams/334-354651",
    "lang": "en",
