    "chunk_text": "More than a celebration, the evening offered a platform for meaningful exchange with Sri Lanka\u2019s corporate leadership and key industry stakeholders, reflecting Accor\u2019s commitment to building lasting relationships as it continues to grow in the market.\n\nThe guests also experienced first-hand Pullman\u2019s approach to contemporary hospitality, where business, leisure and social moments come together.\n\nSoftlogic Group and Softlogic Holdings Chairman and Managing Director Ashok Pathirage said, \u201cCelebrating the arrival of Pullman in Sri Lanka alongside our partners at Accor is a proud moment for Softlogic Holdings. Pullman Colombo Downtown and Pullman Bentota Resort & Spa reflect our long-term confidence in Sri Lanka\u2019s tourism potential and we believe they will set new benchmarks for premium hospitality in the country.\u201d\n\nThe arrival of Pullman through its Colombo and Bentota properties marks an important chapter in Accor\u2019s continued growth in Sri Lanka. Together, the two hotels strengthen the group\u2019s presence across complementary business and leisure destinations, reinforcing its commitment to developing meaningful industry partnerships and supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s continued growth as an international travel destination.\n\nPullman Hotels & Resorts is a premium global hospitality brand designed for the modern, connected traveller. The brand brings together contemporary design, intuitive service, distinctive culinary experiences, wellness and vibrant social spaces to create hotels where the guests can work, connect, recharge and explore."
