    "md5": "9804fb4dc2c31d4e7eac8d0dd659511f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1211,
    "chunk_text": "HNB FINANCE takes financial inclusion drive to 26 towns\n\nGlimpses of HNB FINANCE\u2019s \u2018Diyunuwata Maga \u2013 Nagara Charika\u2019 roadshow\n\nHNB FINANCE PLC launched a nationwide roadshow titled \u2018HNB FINANCE Diyunuwata Maga \u2013 Nagara Charika\u2019 (Road to Progress \u2013 Town Tour) to bring financial services closer to communities, strengthen customer engagement and promote financial inclusion across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe initiative covered 26 towns over 13 days, providing residents and businesses with opportunities to interact directly with HNB FINANCE representatives and learn about financial products and services suited to their needs.\n\nThe roadshow formed part of HNB FINANCE\u2019s efforts to improve financial accessibility by extending customer engagement beyond its branch network. Company representatives visited town centres and other public locations to provide information on available financial solutions, respond to customer inquiries and better understand the financial requirements of local communities.\n\nHNB FINANCE Chief Manager Corporate Marketing Communications and Digital Business Madhura Wijeratne said, \u201cAt HNB FINANCE, we believe financial services should be easily accessible to everyone.\u201d"
