    "md5": "9c4f02838c2ba14c5039f71ca33c07f3",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1571,
    "chunk_text": "ComBank partners with Daraz 11.11\n\nFrom left: Daraz Sri Lanka Country Payment Head Ashani Lidya, Brand Manager Safwan Yaseen, Managing Director Rukshan Xavier, Commercial Bank Chief Manager Card Centre Seevali Wickramasinghe, Senior Manager Merchant Solutions and Partnership Management Kalinga Divaratne and Merchant Solutions and Partnership Management Prabath Gangabada\n\nFlat 25 percent discount during Brand Rush Hour and 12-month instalment plans for eligible cardholders\n\nDemonstrating the bank\u2019s commitment to offering the customers the best value throughout the year, Commercial Bank of Ceylon has partnered with Daraz Sri Lanka to kick off the festive season with Daraz 11.11, the platform\u2019s flagship annual shopping campaign.\n\nDriving exceptional value during the mega sale, the collaboration offers Commercial Bank credit and debit cardholders a flat 25 percent discount during the highly anticipated \u2018Brand Rush Hour\u2019, which launches at 8:00 p.m. on November 10 and concludes on November 21, 2026.\n\nThe eligible Commercial Bank credit cardholders may also opt for 12-month instalment plans on purchases made during the campaign, enabling them to manage their spending with greater flexibility.\n\nIn its 10th consecutive year in Sri Lanka, the highly anticipated campaign continues to scale, offering the Commercial Bank cardholders exclusive deals across more than 120 top-tier brands. The customers can maximise their savings across a comprehensive range of categories, from electronics and home appliances to fashion, beauty, groceries and lifestyle."
