    "md5": "7153a0b848b02d94285066dd5146cdd8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2022,
    "chunk_text": "LeMS converts existing petrol-powered three-wheelers to electric by replacing the conventional engine with an electric drivetrain. Under its battery rental model, customers pay the conversion cost upfront, while LeMS provides the battery on a rental basis over an agreed period, typically three to five years, subject to the applicable terms and warranty.\n\nAccording to LeMS estimates, owners could save up to Rs. 40,000 per month through reduced fuel and maintenance expenses, depending on their daily mileage, operating conditions and applicable conversion and battery rental costs. These potential savings could help ease operating expenses and improve the financial sustainability of their livelihoods.\n\nCommenting on the partnership, Romani de Silva, Deputy Chairman and Managing Director of Alliance Finance Company PLC said, \u201cThis partnership is about more than financing electric vehicles. Further, this partnershipdirectly contributes to one of AFC\u2019s strategic goals- \u201cdrive towards sustainable mobility solutions\u201d. Converting fossil fuel TukTuks to electric, we promote mobility decarbonization and aligns with environmental sustainability goals while meeting the growing demand for efficient, green transportation options.\u201d\n\nNatasha Silva, Director of Lanka E-Mobility Solutions (Pvt) Ltd, commented, \u201cFor many three-wheeler owners, their vehicle is their livelihood. Our goal is to make the transition to electric mobility practical and accessible. By combining our conversion technology and battery solutions with Alliance Finance\u2019s financing expertise and branch network, we hope to help more Sri Lankans experience the benefits of electric transportation.\u201d\n\nThe transport sector remains an important area for Sri Lanka\u2019s efforts to reduce greenhouse gas emissions, improve urban air quality and strengthen energy sustainability. Initiatives that make cleaner transport options more accessible can contribute to these broader objectives while creating practical benefits for vehicle owners."
  },
