    "chunk_text": "As the business scales, Blue Yonder Allocation and Replenishment will apply machine learning forecasting to keep inventory aligned with demand, including seasonal peaks. Because every capability runs on the Blue Yonder Platform, each solution Hayleys Retail adds draws on the same data and the same AI, so the business gets smarter as it grows.\n\n\u201cDigital transformation has been a key driver of how we create greater value across the Group, empowering our teams and enabling us to serve our customers better. Building a new retail business allows us to embed that approach from day one. With Blue Yonder, our teams will have AI-driven insight to deliver a seamless, consistent shopping experience across every store. This collaboration represents an important step in building a future-ready retail business.\u201d\n\n\u201cFew retailers get to choose their operating model before their first store opens,\u201d said Antonio Boccalandro, President, APAC, Blue Yonder. \u201cHayleys Retail is choosing one where AI is the foundation rather than an add-on\u2014connected data and agentic AI built into core merchandising operations, and planning that learns as the business grows. That is exactly what we built our Cognitive Solutions and Blue Yonder Platform to deliver, and we\u2019re proud to support Hayleys Retail, a member of Hayleys PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and most diversified conglomerate as it builds a modern supermarket business and as Blue Yonder expands its presence in South Asia.\u201d"
