    "description": "EFC launches book on \u2018Collective Bargaining and Agreements in Sri Lanka\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/EFC-launches-book-on-Collective-Bargaining-and-Agreements-in-Sri-Lanka/215-354677",
    "lang": "en",
