    "chunk_text": "Opposition launches budget tracking website\n\nColombo, Nov. 11 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Opposition has launched a new website, oversight.lk, aimed at keeping citizens informed by scrutinizing the government\u2019s financial performance across its two previous budgets as well as the upcoming budget.\n\nThe newly unveiled platform features progress trackers for past budgets, detailed ministry-by-ministry analyses, audit query reports concerning state institutions, and analytical data breaking down government revenue sources and expenditure.\n\nThe launch comes just ahead of the President\u2019s Budget Speech scheduled for tomorrow."
