    "chunk_text": "Traffic disrupted on Badulla\u2013Colombo road due to earth slip at Uduwara\n\nColombo, Nov. 11 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Vehicular movement between Badulla and Bandarawela along the Badulla\u2013Colombo main road has come to a complete standstill following a major earth slip at the Uduwara 6th Mile Post area.\n\nThe Road Development Authority (RDA) advises motorists traveling from Badulla toward Colombo, Ella, Wellawaya, and Bandarawela to use the Badulla\u2013Hali-Ela\u2013Attampitiya\u2013Bandarawela road as an alternative route until clearing operations are completed."
