    "chunk_size_bytes": 716,
    "chunk_text": "Aluwihare played a pivotal role in establishing Sri Lanka\u2019s first foreign-currency-designated, multi-services Special Economic Zone, working closely with the Presidential Secretariat as a member of the Colombo International Financial Centre Steering Committee Task Force.\n\nA former Director and Head of Mergers and Acquisitions at PwC Sri Lanka and Maldives, he also serves as an Independent, Non-Executive Director of Bank of Ceylon, the largest commercial bank in Sri Lanka and Abans Finance PLC.\n\nAberdeen Group is confident that Aluwihare\u2019s expertise in investment, capital markets and corporate governance will be invaluable to Ex-pack as it builds on the strong foundation laid under Kassim\u2019s leadership."
