    "chunk_text": "Local television news footage showed rescue workers \u200bwith search dogs combing \u200bthrough the building's ruins, \u2060removing debris in buckets, seeking any signs of people who may have been trapped in voids beneath the debris.\n\nNew York television station WABC-TV reported that \u200bat least four survivors were pulled from the wreckage about 2 to 2 \u200b1/2 hours \u2060after the collapse, including a pregnant woman.\n\nThe \u2060Fire Department initially \u200bsaid four people were critically injured and six more sustained \u200bminor injuries before the first two survivors to be rescued were pulled from the debris."
