    "chunk_text": "Clash erupts at Ruwanweli Maha Seya satyagraha site\n\nColombo, Nov. 12 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Unrest erupted at a satyagraha site being held in front of the Ruwanweli Maha Seya in Anuradhapura today, following a heated confrontation between two groups of lay people.\n\nThe clash broke out when a group of lay people, including Ven. Balangoda Kassapa Thera, who was staging a fast unto death, arrived at the site and confronted another group led by Rajanganaya Saddharathana Thera, who has been expelled from the Buddhist order.\n\nDuring the confrontation, Rajanganaya Saddharathana Thera sustained a head injury after being allegedly assaulted with a club by members of the group at the fasting site."
