    "chunk_size_bytes": 956,
    "chunk_text": "LAUGFS Gas to resume cylinder deliveries after arrival of 3,000+ MT LPG shipment\n\nColombo, Nov. 12 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0LAUGFS Gas PLC will resume LPG cylinder deliveries in phases following the arrival of a shipment carrying more than 3,000 metric tonnes of liquefied petroleum gas (LPG), the company announced today (12).\n\nThe vessel GAS GOODWILL arrived in Sri Lanka carrying the consignment, which is expected to help restore supplies following the recent disruption.\n\nOnce the cargo is unloaded, LAUGFS Gas will commence cylinder filling and dispatch supplies through its distributor and dealer network.\n\nThe company said availability would gradually improve as deliveries reached local outlets.\n\nAcknowledging the difficulties customers faced in obtaining refills, LAUGFS Gas thanked them for their patience.\n\nCustomers have been advised to check stock availability with their nearest authorised LAUGFS Gas dealer or call 1345 before visiting an outlet."
