    "chunk_text": "Tourism Development Levy to be abolished from April 2027\n\nColombo, Nov. 12 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Tourism Development Levy (TDL), imposed under the Finance Act No. 25 of 2003, will be abolished with effect from April 1, 2027, under the 2027 Budget proposals.\n\nThe move will end the levy imposed on the tourism sector under the existing legislation."
