    "description": "The IMF, World Bank and ADB must reinvent themselves for a new world order",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-IMF-World-Bank-and-ADB-must-reinvent-themselves-for-a-new-world-order/4-800046",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
