    "description": "What social media can, and cannot shape or predict around elections",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/What-social-media-can-and-cannot-shape-or-predict-around-elections/4-800048",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
