    "chunk_text": "Negligence in drain cleaning contributed to recent Colombo floods: Minister\n\nColombo, Nov. 13 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Negligence in maintaining and cleaning drainage systems in Colombo City was a major factor behind the recent flooding, Minister of Public Administration and Local Government A. H. M. Abeyrathana told Parliament today.\n\nResponding to an oral question raised by MP Mujibur Rahman, the Minister also identified unauthorised structures as another contributing factor to the flooding."
