    "chunk_text": "Our target is to provide reliable internet connections to all secondary schools. At present, reliable internet connections have been provided to 6,225 schools, including 3,009 connections provided this year. Steps will be taken to provide connections to the remaining 750 schools expeditiously. This programme will also be launched for primary schools.\n\nAccordingly, Rs. 35,000 million has been allocated in 2027 for digitalization, the implementation of teacher capacity development programmes, and the development of other infrastructure, including the development and modernization of Teachers\u2019 Colleges, National Colleges of Education, school buildings, school laboratories and teachers\u2019 hostels.\n\nRs.450 million has been allocated for 2027 for the construction of fully-fledged Faculties of Medicine and clinical buildings at the Universities of Peradeniya and Wayamba, with an investment of Rs.8,000 million.\n\nRs.2,250 million has been allocated for the development of academic and infrastructure facilities, including the construction of a fully-fledged building for the Faculty of Science of the Eastern University, laboratory complexes with computer and research facilities for the Universities of Ruhuna and Sabaragamuwa, buildings for the Faculty of Allied Health Sciences of the University of Jaffna and for the Faculty of Commerce and Management Studies and the Faculty of Science of the University of Kelaniya, a laboratory complex for the Rajarata University, and multipurpose buildings for the Faculties of Management of the Uva Wellassa University and the University of Colombo."
