    "chunk_text": "Microsoft reports \u2018encouraging recovery progress\u2019 in global outage\n\nNov. 13 (Daily Mirror) - Microsoft just said it is seeing \u201cencouraging recovery progress\u201d at the same time as some social media users and CNN journalists report receiving emails in their inboxes again.\n\nIn a statement on X, the company reported \u201cemail delivery performance improving across a growing portion of affected Microsoft 356 infrastructure,\u201d but warned some users may still \u201cexperience intermittent issues.\u201d\n\nWhile some social media users reported getting emails again, others said they were still unable to access them."
