    "chunk_text": "Youth arrested for abducting and raping 12-year-old girl\n\nColombo, Nov. 14 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Buttala Police arrested a young person for allegedly abducting a 12-year-old girl (aged 12 years and 11 months) and raping her. The girl resided near the 'Dekahamaara' section of the Wellawaya-Ella Road.\n\nThe girl\u2019s mother had filed a complaint with the police reporting her daughter missing. During the subsequent investigation, the girl and her boyfriend were discovered at the boyfriend's residence in the Gonagangara area of \u200b\u200bButtala and were taken into custody.\n\nAccording to the girl\u2019s statement, she contacted her boyfriend by phone, claiming she was ill, and asked him to meet her near a bus stop in the '06 Kanuwa' area so she could obtain medicine. The boyfriend arrived on a motorcycle, picked her up, and took her to his home.\n\nThe Buttala and Gonagangara Police stations are conducting a joint investigation."
