    "chunk_text": "He maintained that the Chief Magistrate had issued the bail order within the framework of the law and questioned the legal basis for the Commission\u2019s application, arguing that the serious heart condition of the suspect\u2019s mother had been reasonably considered by the Magistrate as an exceptional circumstance.\n\nPresident\u2019s Counsel Ali Sabry stated that Namal Rajapaksa\u2019s mother had 95% blockage in her heart and questioned how such circumstances could be considered ordinary.\n\nPresident\u2019s Counsel Ali Sabry therefore requested court to dismiss the Bribery Commission\u2019s application for an interim injunction.\n\nHaving considered the submissions, the Colombo High Court Judge announced that the order on whether to issue the requested interim injunction would be delivered on November 18."
