    "chunk_size_bytes": 1642,
    "chunk_text": "It is nothing but a theatrical curtain-raiser for a much broader, systemic offensive against the NPP Government and President Anura Kumara Dissanayake (AKD).\u00a0 It is a war by other means\u2014the other means being the saffron shield.\n\nBy demanding that a secular prison, with its rigorous order, be pliant enough to bend to ecclesiastical jurisdiction under their interpretation of what the Buddha taught as Dhamma and what the Buddha dictated as \u2018Vinaya\u2019, the Kotte Chapter of the Siam Nikaya hierarchy has brought the nation-State to a critical crossroad.\n\nWe are compelled to ask a foundational question that fifty years of constitutional appeasement of the Sangha Order have sought to evade\u2014first in the 1972 constitution, and second with the 1978 constitution.\n\nAre we a modern, true Republic in the Rousseauvian sense\u2014where the General Will of sovereign citizens is absolute\u2014or are we a de facto theocracy where judicial accountability stops at the command of the Buddhist supra clergy.\n\nIn his \u2018The Social Contract\u2019\u00a0 Rousseau leaves no room for such ecclesiastical dualism. He dictates that sovereignty is nothing less than the exercise of the General Will, declaring that it is \u2018inalienable\u2019 and that \u2018the sovereign, who is no other than a collective being, can be represented only by himself.\n\nTo Rousseau, any private faction or partial society that demands a separate exemption from the common law breaks the social pact, for the collective citizenry alone holds the absolute authority to govern the republic.\n\nThe foundational architecture of this self-inflicted crisis was laid during the post-independence era."
