    "description": "From monsoon to management: Colombo\u2019s heavy weather and building a flood-resilient Sri Lanka \u2013 Part I",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-monsoon-to-management-Colombo-s-heavy-weather-and-building-a-flood-resilient-Sri-Lanka-Part-I/4-800073",
