    "chunk_size_bytes": 1548,
    "chunk_text": "Modern Pack Lanka wins Gold at CNCI Achiever Awards 2026\n\nCEO Lahiru Wijerathna (right) and the Modern Pack Lanka team receiving the CNCI Gold Award 2026\n\nModern Pack Lanka Ltd., has won the prestigious Gold Award in the Extra Large Category at National Level at the CNCI Achiever Awards 2026, organised by the Ceylon National Chamber of Industries (CNCI), Sri Lanka\u2019s oldest industrial chamber. This recognition reflects the company\u2019s commitment to manufacturing excellence, innovation and sustainable growth.\n\nEstablished in 1993 by Sheamalee Wickramasinghe and Nishka Wickramasinghe as a joint venture with Modern Pack Singapore, the company initially supplied biscuit trays to Ceylon Biscuits Ltd. Over three decades, Modern Pack has grown into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading packaging manufacturers, serving customers across the dairy, FMCG, confectionery, bakery, poultry, electronics and apparel sectors.\n\nIts diverse manufacturing capabilities include thermoforming, injection molding, in-mold labelling (iml), blow molding, sheet extrusion and aluminium foil packaging, enabling the company to deliver innovative packaging solutions to leading local and multinational brands.\n\nModern Pack\u2019s international achievements include winning WorldStar Packaging Awards in 2015 and 2025, presented by the World Packaging Organisation. Recognised as the highest international accolade in packaging, WorldStar celebrates outstanding innovation and excellence. The company\u2019s 2025 award recognised its sustainable moulded-pulp packaging solution."
  },
