    "chunk_size_bytes": 1109,
    "chunk_text": "NEO Technologies hosts \u2018NEO Hard Talk 2026\u2019\n\nNEO Technologies (Pvt) Ltd hosted its premier \u2018NEO Hard Talk 2026\u2019 aboard the elegant 8 Degrees Boat at Cinnamon Lakeside, Colombo recently, bringing together diplomats, and professionals for an evening of intellectual engagement, inspiration and meaningful dialogue.\n\nThe event featured thought-provoking insights into Sri Lanka\u2019s extraordinary biodiversity, particularly its unique cloud forests and biodiversity hotspots, followed by an inspiring presentation titled \u201cThe Sweet Spot of Management\u201d by Major (Retd.) Tissa Aluwihare, founder of NEO Technologies. Drawing upon his remarkable entrepreneurial journey, Aluwihare shared valuable perspectives on leadership, organisational transformation and the importance of empowering individuals to achieve collective success.\n\nThe highlight of the evening was the unveiling of NEO\u2019s \u2018Black Box Book\u2019, a working manual documenting the company\u2019s indigenous management systems, concepts and organisational practices, reflecting its commitment to institutional excellence and sustainable growth."
