    "chunk_text": "Rotary Club of Ja-Ela - Kandana marks 52nd installation\n\nThe Rotary Club of Ja-Ela \u2013 Kandana celebrated its 52nd Installation Ceremony on 11 October at Ramada by Wyndham Katunayake, marking another significant milestone in the club\u2019s distinguished history of fellowship, leadership, and community service.\n\nThe occasion witnessed the formal installation of Rotarian Malitha Fernando as President for the Rotary year 2026\u20132027, ushering in a new chapter of leadership dedicated to strengthening community engagement, developing meaningful partnerships, and creating sustainable social impact.\n\nFernando expressed his gratitude to the club\u2019s membership and acknowledged the invaluable contributions of past leaders who helped establish its enduring legacy.\n\nUnder President Fernando\u2019s leadership, the club aims to strengthen its commitment to community development through initiatives focusing on healthcare, education, financial literacy, environmental sustainability, and support for vulnerable communities."
