    "chunk_size_bytes": 961,
    "chunk_text": "Sriyani Dress Point marks Colombo debut with new showroom\n\nSriyani Dress Point has entered Colombo\u2019s fashion retail market with the opening of its new showroom in Wellawatte.\n\nThe ceremonial opening was graced by Indian actress Pooja Hegde, alongside cricketers, celebrities and other distinguished guests. The occasion marked the retailer\u2019s arrival in Sri Lanka\u2019s commercial capital and the beginning of a new phase of growth for the Sri Lankan brand.\n\nThe Colombo debut followed a teaser campaign under the tagline \u201cKolamba Ayata, Colombo Hayata\u201d, which built curiosity around the brand\u2019s plans before revealing the new showroom.\n\nEstablished in 1993, Sriyani Dress Point built its presence through eight showrooms across six cities including Kegalle, Kurunegala, Kandy, Matale, Negombo and Ratnapura, with two each in Kurunegala and Kandy, before entering Colombo. The retailer was recognised as Most Popular Retailer at the Pinnacle Awards 2025."
