    "chunk_text": "Adding further value, the winners who hold an Amana Bank Kids account or Teen account will receive double the respective prize value. The winning essays will be adjudicated by an eminent panel of judges comprising university lecturers and school teachers.\n\nTo participate in the competition, the students can submit their essays either via the online portal (tinyurl.com/MyFutureMyDream), via post sent to 353 Galle Road, Colombo 3 or by handing over at any Amana Bank\u2019s branches before 20 December 2026.\n\nSubmissions should include the full name, school, date of birth, contact number, address, along with the name and signature of the participant\u2019s parent/guardian. More information can be availed by calling the bank\u2019s hotline 0117 756 756 or visiting any of the nearest branches."
