    "chunk_size_bytes": 780,
    "chunk_text": "For women taking their first steps into business, the proposed support includes training in legal requirements, bookkeeping and taxation, alongside industry-specific guidance. The objective is to help them navigate the demands of launching an enterprise while reducing the time, costs and risks involved.\n\nThe collaboration also puts the spotlight on young women entrepreneurs, providing guidance and technical support during the critical early stages of building a business.\n\nAccess to mentoring and business networks is expected to help the participants refine their ideas, make better-informed decisions and identify avenues for raising the funds needed to establish or grow their ventures.\n\nThe MoU covers an initial period of one year and may be extended by mutual agreement."
