    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/SLT-Mobitel-empowers-over-1-000-students/215-354901",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1794640412.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-11-14-dailymirrorlk-40cdfa17-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "fc033d8c77d3280d58a42e5d3e456d5c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1962,
    "chunk_text": "SLT-Mobitel empowers over 1,000 students\n\nFrom essential school supplies to a state-of-the-art smart classroom, SLT-Mobitel advances inclusive education and digital learning opportunities for children.\n\nSLT-Mobitel reaffirmed its commitment to advancing inclusive education and empowering the next generation through a series of initiatives to mark the World Children\u2019s Day.\n\nBenefiting over 1,000 students at Gamini Primary College in Kalawana and Sidhartha Vidyalaya in Walikadamulla, Wattala, the initiatives combined technology-enabled learning with essential educational support, expanding opportunities for children to learn, grow and reach their full potential.\n\nStrengthening access to digital education in rural Sri Lanka, SLT-Mobitel gifted a state-of-the-art smart classroom facility to Gamini Primary College in Kalawana. Equipped with a high-speed SLT-Mobitel fibre connection and an advanced interactive smart board, the facility introduces modern digital learning capabilities into the classroom, creating an enriched and interactive learning environment.\n\nThe facility benefits over 900 students and their teachers by providing access to digital learning platforms, interactive educational content and a wealth of online educational resources. By integrating reliable connectivity and modern technology into everyday teaching, the initiative enhances learning experiences, encourages classroom interaction and helps bridge the digital divide, bringing new educational opportunities within reach of rural students.\n\nSLT-Mobitel donated essential school supplies to 150 students at Sidhartha Vidyalaya in Walikadamulla, Wattala. Bringing together students from diverse communities in a shared learning environment, the school provides an important foundation for inclusive education. The donation aims to support students\u2019 day-to-day learning needs, enhance their educational experiences and encourage them to pursue their academic aspirations."
  },
