    "md5": "c69b63096d66e7c1982c8148eb7e9c1e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 549,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cWe are confident that the measures announced in Budget 2027 will serve as catalysts for a new era of capital market participation and contribute meaningfully to Sri Lanka\u2019s economic growth and prosperity.\u201d\n\n\u201cThese are not merely budget proposals. They are investments in Sri Lanka\u2019s future investors, future entrepreneurs and future economic growth. The SEC is proud that these long-standing proposals have been taken into consideration and we remain committed to ensuring their successful implementation for the benefit of the nation.\u201d"
