    "date_str": "2026-11-14",
    "description": "Balfour\u2019s shadow hangs over Gaza\u2019s biting winter",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Balfours-shadow-hangs-over-Gazas-biting-winter/172-354914",
