    "chunk_text": "Musk says Nvidia will lose \u2019critical\u2019 deals without Jensen Huang\n\nThe Korea Times - Elon Musk said chipmaker Nvidia would lose \"critical\" deals without its now ousted CEO Jensen Huang, in a post on X on Saturday.\n\nMusk said that while Huang drove supply chain \"brilliantly\" at Nvidia, many such deals were \"a handshake with Jensen, not a written contract.\""
