    "date_str": "2026-11-15",
    "description": "Did Bing Chun really fail safety tests? The company finally responds",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Did-Bing-Chun-really-fail-safety-tests-The-company-finally-responds/108-354932",
