    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "608ed538694c2d714e7addff419e3faf",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1968,
    "chunk_text": "The matter concerned the prescribed compositional standards applicable to two products marketed as vanilla ice cream and chocolate ice cream, particularly the minimum requirements relating to fat content and total solids under the relevant Food (Standards) Regulations of Sri Lanka.\n\nIt is important to distinguish between a product's compliance with prescribed compositional standards and a determination that a product is unsafe or unfit for human consumption.\n\nAccordingly, we respectfully request that the public and media distinguish between the actual nature of the regulatory findings and broader allegations concerning consumer health and safety.\n\nBing Chun fully respects the laws, regulations and regulatory authorities of Sri Lanka.\n\nWe acknowledge the importance of complying with the prescribed food standards applicable to products marketed and sold within the country.\n\nWe also respect the judicial process and the decisions of the competent courts.\n\nIn response to this matter, we are reviewing the relevant product specifications, descriptions and applicable regulatory requirements to ensure that appropriate corrective measures are implemented.\n\nWe remain committed to cooperating with the relevant regulatory authorities and addressing matters brought to our attention in accordance with Sri Lankan law.\n\nThe confidence and trust of Sri Lankan consumers are of the utmost importance to Bing Chun.\n\nWe recognise our responsibility to ensure that products offered under our brand comply with applicable legal and regulatory requirements.\n\nAccordingly, we are taking steps to review the relevant product formulations, quality specifications and product descriptions.\n\nWhere necessary, appropriate adjustments will be made to ensure that our products are accurately described and comply with the applicable regulatory framework.\n\nWe remain committed to maintaining consistent product quality and providing consumers with clear and accurate information."
  },
