    "chunk_text": "Where necessary, appropriate adjustments will be made to ensure that our products are accurately described and comply with the applicable regulatory framework.\n\nWe remain committed to maintaining consistent product quality and providing consumers with clear and accurate information.\n\nWe will review the findings and implement any necessary corrective measures in accordance with the applicable requirements.\n\nWe are also strengthening our internal procedures for monitoring product specifications and regulatory compliance across our operations.\n\nThese measures are intended to reinforce consumer confidence and maintain consistent standards throughout the Bing Chun network.\n\nWe respect the role of the media in informing the public and recognise the importance of transparent and responsible reporting.\n\nAt the same time, we respectfully emphasise that noncompliance with a prescribed compositional standard should not automatically be represented as proof that a product is dangerous to human health.\n\nWe therefore encourage accurate and balanced reporting that reflects the actual nature of the findings and avoids creating unnecessary public concern through unsupported conclusions.\n\nBing Chun reserves its legal rights in respect of any false, misleading or defamatory statements that may cause unwarranted damage to its reputation.\n\nBing Chun values the trust and support extended by Sri Lankan consumers.\n\nWe remain committed to operating responsibly, respecting the country's laws and regulations, and continuously improving our products and quality assurance procedures.\n\nWe sincerely appreciate the concerns expressed by our customers and the guidance provided by the relevant regulatory authorities.\n\nWe assure our valued consumers that we will continue taking appropriate measures to maintain regulatory compliance, product quality and consumer confidence."
