    "chunk_text": "Wife of former Speaker Chamal Rajapaksa passes away\n\nColombo, Nov. 15 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Chandra Malini Rajapaksa, the wife of former Speaker and former Minister Chamal Rajapaksa, has passed away.\n\nShe reportedly died while receiving treatment at the Karapitiya Teaching Hospital in Galle.\n\nShe was also the mother of former Uva Province Chief Minister Shasheendra Rajapaksa.\n\nChamal Rajapaksa is a senior politician who has served as Speaker of Parliament and held several ministerial portfolios."
