    "chunk_text": "The ICC World Test Championship Final will continue to remain a biennial fixture in June till 2035. England will be the hosts for the 2029 and 2031 editions as well, while the hosts are to be confirmed for 2033 and 2035.\n\nAs of now, Australia hold the Men\u2019s Cricket World Cup, South Africa have the World Test Championship mace, while India are the holders of both the Men\u2019s T20 World Cup and Men\u2019s Champions Trophy."
