    "description": "Athukorala\u2019s Asian global production experiences: Lessons for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Athukorala-s-Asian-global-production-experiences-Lessons-for-Sri-Lanka/4-800116",
