    "chunk_text": "Athukorala offers a bold and clear analysis of the economic challenges facing these Asian countries. His book not only explains past failures but also points to the steps they need to take next. It is a timely and valuable guide for developing nations, especially Sri Lanka, seeking lasting prosperity for their people. Athukorala has laid out the roadmap; it is now up to Sri Lanka\u2019s policymakers to read it and act on its lessons\n\n(The author, a former Deputy Governor of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka, can be reached at [email\u00a0protected])"
  },
  {
