    "description": "Investing in Sri Lanka\u2019s resilience: The case for patient capital",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Investing-in-Sri-Lanka-s-resilience-The-case-for-patient-capital/4-800118",
    "lang": "en",
