    "chunk_text": "German national dies after drowning at Hikkaduwa Beach\n\nGalle, Nov 16 (Daily Mirror) - A 71-year-old German national has died after being swept away by a strong current while bathing at Narigama Beach in Hikkaduwa.\n\nPolice said the foreign national had been caught in a current and swept out to sea while bathing at the beach.\n\nArea residents rescued the man from the water and rushed him to Balapitiya Hospital, where he later succumbed to his injuries while receiving treatment.\n\nThe body has been placed at the Balapitiya Hospital mortuary pending a post-mortem examination."
