    "description": "Anti-Houthi forces retreat in Yemen as Iran strikes Bahrain",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Anti-Houthi-forces-retreat-in-Yemen-as-Iran-strikes-Bahrain/107-354974",
