    "description": "DPL Group reports Rs. 50bn revenue in 1st half 2026/27",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/DPL-Group-reports-Rs-50bn-revenue-in-1st-half-202627/215-354977",
    "lang": "en",
