    "date_str": "2026-11-16",
    "description": "DFCC Bank-Mels Automobiles offer leasing solutions for BMWs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/DFCC-Bank-Mels-Automobiles-offer-leasing-solutions-for-BMWs/215-354979",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1794811444.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-11-16-dailymirrorlk-b9134ea9-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "ffda3854e0e311f1e34720393194e630",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1686,
    "chunk_text": "DFCC Bank-Mels Automobiles offer leasing solutions for BMWs\n\nDFCC Bank becomes Mels Automobiles\u2019 1st banking partner to enhance BMW ownership experience\n\nFlexible leasing and exclusive after-sales benefits bring financing, authorised service and premium mobility together for BMW customers\n\nThe customers aspiring to own a BMW can now access flexible DFCC Leasing solutions together with exclusive service and warranty benefits through a new strategic partnership between DFCC Bank and Mels Automobiles (Pvt.) Ltd.\n\nThe partnership was formalised through a memorandum of understanding signed recently, with the participation of senior representatives from both organisations.\n\nIt marks Mels Automobiles\u2019 first banking partnership since assuming the authorised BMW dealership in Sri Lanka, with DFCC Bank becoming its inaugural banking partner.\n\nThe collaboration brings together DFCC Bank\u2019s financing expertise and Mels Automobiles\u2019 premium automotive and after-sales capabilities, creating a more connected experience from vehicle selection and financing to servicing and longer-term ownership.\n\nThrough the partnership, the eligible customers can access DFCC Leasing facilities with repayment periods of up to seven years at competitive interest rates, subject to credit evaluation and applicable terms and conditions.\n\nThe customers obtaining financing through DFCC Bank will also receive three complimentary services and an additional two-year warranty from Mels Automobiles, extending the total warranty period, subject to applicable terms and conditions.\n\nThe financing proposition is available to the eligible customers seeking to purchase a BMW through Mels Automobiles."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
