    "language": "en",
    "md5": "1a49c296538e5e197d58eeb4c3e35c93",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1527,
    "chunk_text": "The customers obtaining financing through DFCC Bank will also receive three complimentary services and an additional two-year warranty from Mels Automobiles, extending the total warranty period, subject to applicable terms and conditions.\n\nThe financing proposition is available to the eligible customers seeking to purchase a BMW through Mels Automobiles.\n\nDFCC Bank Director and Chief Executive Officer Thimal Perera said, \u201cFor many customers, owning a BMW represents years of ambition, progress and personal achievement. Our role is to make the financial path towards that aspiration more considered, flexible and reassuring. By bringing together DFCC Bank\u2019s financing expertise and the premium automotive experience offered by Mels Automobiles, we are creating an ownership journey that reflects the quality and confidence the customers expect from both brands.\u201d\n\nMels Automobiles Chief Executive Officer Anushka Polonowita said, \u201cWhen you choose a BMW, you are choosing the team and the institution behind it. As part of Melstacorp, Mels Automobiles brings that stability to every customer and our first banking partnership with DFCC Bank carries it into the buying journey itself. Flexible financing, genuine vehicles, authorised after-sales care and an extended warranty come together in a single promise to look after our customers well beyond the day they collect their car. This is the first of many steps in a new chapter for BMW in Sri Lanka and we intend to build it with our customers and our partners.\u201d"
  },
