    "md5": "6fde508b5c2d3a380bcf356354b0e74a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1848,
    "chunk_text": "Vallibel Finance opens Dehiattakandiya, Karapitiya, Tissamaharama branches\n\nVallibel Finance has further strengthened its presence across Sri Lanka with the opening of two new branches in Karapitiya and Tissamaharama in the Southern province, reinforcing the company\u2019s commitment to expanding access to financial services, promoting financial inclusion and supporting regional economic development.\n\nThese two branch openings follow the recent inauguration of Vallibel Finance\u2019s Dehiattakandiya branch last month, further strengthening the company\u2019s islandwide presence.\n\nThe new branches are expected to enhance convenience and accessibility for individuals, entrepreneurs and businesses across the Galle, Hambantota and Ampara districts by bringing a comprehensive range of financial solutions closer to the local communities. The expansion marks another milestone in Vallibel Finance\u2019s strategic growth journey, reflecting its continued focus on reaching underserved markets and supporting the evolving financial needs of customers across the country.\n\nAll three branches were ceremonially inaugurated by Vallibel Finance Managing Director Jayantha Rangamuwa, in the presence of the members of the corporate management, employees, valued customers and well-wishers.\n\nAddressing the gatherings, Rangamuwa highlighted the company\u2019s commitment to strengthening its presence throughout the Southern province while delivering accessible, professional and customer-focused financial services that respect the unique cultural and social values of the communities it serves.\n\nHe also emphasised the potential of the new branches to support a diverse range of economic activities, including agriculture, entrepreneurship and local business development, through a comprehensive portfolio of financial solutions tailored to regional requirements."
  },
