    "chunk_size_bytes": 1520,
    "chunk_text": "He also emphasised the potential of the new branches to support a diverse range of economic activities, including agriculture, entrepreneurship and local business development, through a comprehensive portfolio of financial solutions tailored to regional requirements.\n\nSupported by modern technological infrastructure and customer-centric service standards, the company remains focused on delivering efficient, accessible and reliable financial solutions that respond to the changing needs of individuals and businesses.\n\nThe latest expansion builds on Vallibel Finance\u2019s strong growth trajectory and financial performance. The company surpassed the Rs.200 billion asset milestone within 19 years of operations, reflecting its sustained business growth, financial strength and strategic resilience. This achievement follows another significant milestone in December 2024, when Vallibel Finance became the fastest finance company in Sri Lanka to exceed an asset base of Rs.100 billion, achieving the feat within 17 years of operations.\n\nWith the opening of its Dehiattakandiya, Karapitiya and Tissamaharama branches, Vallibel Finance continues to advance its islandwide expansion strategy, bringing financial services closer to communities while creating opportunities for individuals, entrepreneurs and businesses to pursue their ambitions. Through innovation, accessibility and a continued commitment to customer confidence, the company remains focused on contributing to sustainable economic growth across Sri Lanka."
