    "chunk_size_bytes": 1874,
    "chunk_text": "Bombuwala Consultants leads management excellence programme for   Wayamba Labs\n\nBombuwala Consultants (Pvt.) Ltd successfully conducted a two-day management training programme for Wayamba Diagnostic Medical Laboratory (Pvt.) Ltd, supporting the organisation\u2019s efforts to strengthen the leadership capabilities, enhance managerial effectiveness and build a more collaborative and accountable workplace culture.\n\nDesigned and delivered by Bombuwala Consultants, the programme brought together practical management insights and interactive learning to help the Wayamba Labs\u2019 managers respond effectively to organisational priorities and evolving workplace requirements.\n\nThe training was conducted by two experienced professionals from Bombuwala Consultants: Sujith Bombuwala, MBA (PIM \u2013 University of Sri Jayewardenepura), PGDBM (University of Colombo), PGD.Mkt. (SL), Practising Marketer (SL), Certified Consultant (SL), MSLIM and MCIPM and Thilina Bandara, Programme Lead/Lead Consultant, B.Sc.Eng. (Hons) \u2013 University of Moratuwa, MBA (PIM \u2013 University of Sri Jayewardenepura) and Certified Trainer.\n\nThe programme focused on strengthening the managers\u2019 ability to achieve organisational objectives while supporting employee well-being, encouraging cross-functional collaboration and promoting responsible leadership.\n\nThe key areas included collaborative leadership, scientific decision-making, effective communication, time management, prioritisation, accountability and adaptability. Particular attention was also given to fairness, integrity, inclusiveness and respect in the workplace.\n\nThe programme also covered the resilience framework, practical case studies, AI readiness, marketing and sales growth strategies, interactive discussions and public speaking, equipping the managers with valuable insights for professional and organisational development."
  },
