    "chunk_size_bytes": 1080,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank-Hayleys Mobility expand access to mobility solutions\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank Chief Executive Officer and General Manager Clive Fonseka, Hayleys Mobility Managing Director Hasith Prematillake, Director Business Development Roshini Dharmarathne, People\u2019s Bank Deputy General Manager Retail Banking A.U.A. Anzar, Assistant General Manager Retail Banking Nalin Perera, Chief Manager Personal Loans Ravi Perera and other officials from both organisations at MoU signing ceremony\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank and Hayleys Mobility recently signed a memorandum of understanding (MoU), marking a significant step towards expanding access to innovative, world-class mobility solutions across Sri Lanka.\n\nThis strategic partnership brings together Hayleys Mobility\u2019s automotive expertise and People\u2019s Bank\u2019s trusted financial strength to offer customised financing solutions, greater convenience and enhanced opportunities for customers islandwide.\n\nThe partnership aims to empower Sri Lankans with greater mobility choices while contributing to a more connected and sustainable future."
