    "md5": "5b3f260492c894d2b7e1c50aa2742b91",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 828,
    "chunk_text": "In turn,\u00a0 this has led sections within the Buddhist clergy to believe they are above the law. Balangoda Kassapa Thera\u2019s statement as reported in the media (13 November 2026) that \u201che would not comply with any court order\u201d\u2026 and that \u201cno court order could be served on him and only a Sangha Adhikarana had the authority to issue orders concerning him\u2026\u201d comes out of this mentality. This is a dangerous trend and it needs to be nipped in the bud. Whether Kassapa Thera is merely a tool in the hands of disgruntled politicians will be realised later. But both the government and the heads of the Buddhist Nikkayas need to ensure that all persons in this country realise none is superior to the other.\n\nOur Constitution gives foremost place to Buddhist beliefs \u2013NOT to bigoted personalities clothed in saffron robes."
  },
