    "chunk_text": "\u201cWe are entering one of the most important and exciting periods in our sport\u2019s history. Cricket\u2019s return to the Olympic Games at LA28 presents an extraordinary opportunity to introduce our game to new audiences and inspire a new generation of players and fans,\" he added.\n\n\u201cI have always believed that cricket\u2019s greatest strength lies in its ability to bring people together. With the support of the Board and our Members, our focus will be on turning ambition into action and ensuring that the progress we make leaves a lasting legacy for generations to come,\" he added.\n\nOn Sunday, the ICC confirmed the dates for its multi-team events until 2035. India will host the Champions Trophy in 2029 and co-host the ODI World Cup with Bangladesh in 2031."
