    "chunk_text": "Winners of the National Award of Excellence \u2013 Best Supply Chain Practicing Organisation 2026\n\nn 1st Runner-Ups: John Keells Logistics Ltd., and Global Transportation and Logistics Ltd.\n\nn 2nd Runner-Ups: Logicare Ltd. and Ocean Maritime Ceylon Ltd.\n\nWinners of the National Award of Excellence \u2013 Best Supply Chain Professional 2026\n\nThe Best Supply Chain Professional Awards recognised individuals who have demonstrated exceptional professional capabilities, leadership, dedication, and contributions to advancing Supply Chain Management.\n\nn Winner: R. Kumudu Abayasiri, Managing Director, Ocean Maritime Ceylon Ltd.\n\nn 1st Runner-Up: Aruna Pathirage, Head of Customer Service and Logistics, Unilever Sri Lanka Ltd.\n\nn 2nd Runner-Up: Kashun Thilina Abeywardena, General Manager, Logicare Ltd.\n\nn Merit Award: D. Tilak Fernando, Deputy General Manager \u2013 Supply Chain, Sunshine Healthcare Lanka Ltd.\n\nn Winner: Pubudu Megodawickrama, Senior Manager \u2013 Supply Chain, SriLankan Catering Ltd\n\nl Ushan Hewage, Head of Group Procurement, Anunine Holdings Ltd.\n\nl Retired Wing Commander Sameera Atapattu, Senior Operation Specialist, Hayleys Advantis Ltd\n\nCelebrating more than five decades of service to the profession, ISMM continues to play a pivotal role in strengthening Sri Lanka's supply chain capability through professional development, knowledge sharing, and the promotion of global best practices. The event reaffirmed the institute's commitment to fostering innovation, resilience, and sustainability in supply chains that drive the nation's economic growth."
