    "md5": "c6c3c2c1754e9477ae5bf2139c703ded",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 661,
    "chunk_text": "Road through Maduru Oya National Park to close at night from Nov. 20\n\nThe road section passing through Maduru Oya National Park, between Panijja Oya and Kandegama, will be closed to traffic daily from 6 p.m. to 6 a.m. with effect from November 20.\n\nThe closure applies to the Mah Oya\u2013Aralaganwila road and has been introduced to prevent accidents involving wildlife crossing the road at night.\n\nAuthorities have observed that vehicles travelling through the national park during nighttime hours frequently cause accidents, resulting in injuries and deaths among wild animals.\n\nThe public has been requested to use alternative routes during the closure period."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
