    "md5": "bdd13b081519e8454002871b74dbafc7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 672,
    "chunk_text": "The Court observed that maintaining contemporaneous notes was a fundamental requirement of police duties and that the failure to record important events raised serious doubts about whether the raid had actually taken place in the manner described by the prosecution.\n\nThe Court questioned why the seized heroin had not been weighed and sealed immediately at the scene, despite the police team having the necessary sealing equipment.\n\nThe Court held that the unexplained delay, coupled with the failure to maintain proper records and other investigative deficiencies, created serious doubts regarding the integrity of the production and the prosecution's version of events."
  },
