    "chunk_text": "COOPFED Chairman Dr. Shantha Jayarathne said the CoopFish products would be distributed at fair prices across the country through a network of nearly 4,000 outlets operated by 305 cooperative societies, serving a membership base of around 8.2 million.\n\nRichwin Group Director Vikum Fernando said the company's factories in Madurankuliya and Galle had a combined production capacity of 350,000 cans of fish per day and operated in compliance with international standards, including FSSC and ISO.\n\nThe joint venture was expected to achieve annual sales of Rs. 25 billion within the next two years, he said.\n\nHe added that a project involving 50 deep-sea fish collection vessels was planned to enable the canned fish industry to rely entirely on locally sourced fish within three years, while generating around 6,000 employment opportunities."
