    "chunk_text": "Healthguard opens 17th outlet in Mount Lavinia\n\nHealthguard opened of its 17th outlet in Mount Lavinia recently.\n\nThe new outlet was declared open by Sunshine Holdings PLC Group Chief Executive Officer Shyam Sathasivam and Group Chief People and Corporate Communications Officer Michelle Senanayake, in the presence of Healthguard management and outlet staff.\n\nChief Operations Officer for Healthguard Pharmacy chain, Farman Nizar said, \u201cOur expansion into Mount Lavinia reflects our continued commitment to making quality healthcare more accessible to communities. Through our customer-focused approach and signature Purple Service, we aim to deliver a trusted and personalised pharmacy experience at every Healthguard outlet.\u201d"
