    "chunk_text": "Maliban Group celebrates eight wins at SLIM Awards\n\nMaliban Group has secured eight awards at the SLIM National Sales Awards 2026.\n\nThe recognition highlights the contribution of the Group\u2019s people in strengthening the Maliban brand and supporting its continued growth.\n\nThe SLIM National Sales Awards (NASCO), organised by the Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing (SLIM), recognise outstanding sales professionals and teams for their achievements, capabilities, and contribution to organisational performance. The awards provide a platform to celebrate individuals and teams who demonstrate excellence in sales, leadership, customer engagement, and business performance."
