    "md5": "98b0c11b11d6d32e0cddcaf0ca2441ca",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1108,
    "chunk_text": "Speaking on the project, Nalin Herath said, \u201cCentral Park Boulevard Port City Colombo sets a new benchmark for luxury living in Sri Lanka. For every element of this development, we have engaged the finest expertise in the world, and Home Lands brings these elements together under one vision and one standard. Our customers deserve a true masterpiece, and that is what we are delivering. With construction progressing ahead of schedule, we are on track to complete the project in 36 months.\u201d\n\nOverlooking and merging with the 40-acre Central Park, Central Park Boulevard Port City Colombo rises as high-end, ultra-luxury 40-storey twin towers, designed to become a defining landmark on the Colombo skyline. Every resident enjoys a choice of sweeping views of the parkland, the Indian Ocean and the city, along with world-class amenities.\n\nIts global lifestyle is inspired by one of the world\u2019s most renowned luxury lifestyle brands. Backed by world-class partners at every stage, Central Park Boulevard Port City Colombo is a true reflection of the Home Lands promise: Trust, Innovation and Excellence."
