    "description": "ComBank launches Payable TAP in South Asia\u2019s 1st deployment of Mastercard Cloud Commerce",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/ComBank-launches-Payable-TAP-in-South-Asias-1st-deployment-of-Mastercard-Cloud-Commerce/215-355056",
    "lang": "en",
