    "md5": "2da55834f8aeb790db5135bb6790fb5e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1313,
    "chunk_text": "Designed for accessibility, Payable TAP features a trilingual interface available in Sinhala, Tamil, and English and issues instant digital receipts via SMS or email. The businesses can activate multiple smartphones under a single account, making it an ideal solution for delivery operations and multi-point retail environments.\n\nThe launch reinforces Commercial Bank\u2019s continued leadership in digital payments innovation while extending its long-standing commitment to Sri Lanka\u2019s SME sector in the payments domain. By removing the cost and complexity associated with traditional POS terminals, Payable TAP opens the door for micro and small merchants, from market vendors and food truck operators to delivery riders and seasonal traders, to participate fully in the digital economy.\n\n\u201cThis is about redefining access to payment infrastructure at scale,\u201d Commercial Bank Managing Director and CEO Sanath Manatunge said.\n\n\u201cWhen acceptance moves from hardware to software and from devices to the cloud, the barriers that once limited participation in the digital economy effectively disappear. What we are enabling through this collaboration is not just acceptance but a more resilient and future-ready payments ecosystem that can adapt rapidly to the changing customer behaviours and business models.\u201d"
  },
