    "description": "Seafood exporters seek easier import rules in push for US $ 680mn by 2030",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Seafood-exporters-seek-easier-import-rules-in-push-for-US-680mn-by-2030/215-355059",
    "lang": "en",
