    "chunk_text": "Man arrested over sword-wielding incident near Kurunegala bus stand\n\nColombo, Nov. 17 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0A 48-year-old man who allegedly caused a public disturbance while wielding a sword near the Kurunegala bus stand has been arrested by police.\n\nThe incident occurred on November 15, with video footage showing the suspect behaving aggressively while carrying a sword in the area subsequently going viral on social media.\n\nFollowing investigations into the footage, officers from the Kurunegala Police arrested the suspect in the area yesterday (November 16).\n\nThe suspect is a resident of Galabawewa in Thalawa. Police also recovered the sword allegedly used during the incident.\n\nHe is scheduled to be produced before the Kurunegala Magistrate's Court today (November 17)."
