    "chunk_text": "Leonid meteor shower to illuminate Sri Lankan skies tonight\n\nColombo, Nov. 17 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Leonid meteor shower, described as the most significant meteor shower of the year, will be visible over Sri Lanka tonight (17), astronomer Gihan Weerasekara said.\n\nThe meteor shower can be observed in the eastern sky, with Mars and Jupiter also visible in its vicinity, he said.\n\nThe best opportunity to observe the meteor shower will be during the early hours of tomorrow (18), Weerasekara added."
