    "chunk_size_bytes": 617,
    "chunk_text": "Investigators also informed court that statements had to be recorded from the directors of W.M. Mendis & Company who had signed the relevant cheques.\n\nOfficers also informed court that statements needed to be recorded from the suspect\u2019s family members as part of the ongoing investigations.\n\nFollowing the submissions made by both parties, the Magistrate ordered that the suspect be further remanded till December 1 and directed investigators to expedite the ongoing investigations and conclude them without delay.\n\nSenior Counsel Asoka Weerasooriya, Sanjaya Marambe and Pasan Karunarathna appeared for the suspect."
