    "chunk_text": "Grade 6 school cut-off marks for 2027 released\n\nColombo, Nov. 17 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The cut-off marks for the admission of students to Grade 6 in 2027, based on the 2026 Grade 5 Scholarship Examination results, have been released.\n\nThe Ministry of Education said the cut-off marks could be accessed through its official website, www.moe.gov.lk.\n\nParents can also check the school allocated to their children by visiting https://g6application.moe.gov.lk."
