    "description": "Budget 2027 gives Sri Lanka\u2019s exporters room to grow: An exporters perspective",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Budget-2027-gives-Sri-Lanka-s-exporters-room-to-grow-An-exporters-perspective/4-800215",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
