    "description": "Policy sets direction. Who takes responsibility for implementing?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Policy-sets-direction-Who-takes-responsibility-for-implementing/4-800219",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
