    "description": "GEW Sri Lanka 2026 aims to expand opportunities for entrepreneurs nationwide",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/GEW-Sri-Lanka-2026-aims-to-expand-opportunities-for-entrepreneurs-nationwide/34-800226",
