    "chunk_text": "The agreement would enter into force on the 60th day after receipt of the last written notification through diplomatic channels confirming that both parties had completed the necessary domestic procedures.\n\n\u201cThe agreement will facilitate travel for ordinary passport holders from both sides and promote people-to-people interaction between the two countries, which share close Buddhist and cultural links. It will also help enhance the capacity of Thailand\u2019s tourism industry, particularly cultural tourism and religious activities,\u201d Ploythalay said."
