    "description": "Budget 2027 gives Sri Lanka\u2019s exporters room to grow- an Exporters Perspective",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Budget-2027-gives-Sri-Lankas-exporters-room-to-grow-an-Exporters-Perspective/108-355135",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
