    "chunk_text": "President accepts invitation to visit Bangladesh early next year\n\nColombo, Nov. 18 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0State Minister for Foreign Affairs of Bangladesh, Humaiun Kobir, who called on President Anura Kumara Dissanayake extended an invitation to visit Bangladesh early next year.\n\nThe meeting took place at the Presidential Secretariat in Colombo.\n\nDuring the meeting, the formal invitation of the Prime Minister of Bangladesh\u00a0 Tarique Rahman was handed over.\n\nThe meeting also provided an opportunity to exchange views on bilateral cooperation, trade and investment, regional connectivity and shared development aspirations."
