    "description": "Capital Trust Holdings joins European Chamber of Commerce of Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Capital-Trust-Holdings-joins-European-Chamber-of-Commerce-of-Sri-Lanka/215-355173",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1794985697.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-11-18-dailymirrorlk-686aa361-0001",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "68341c564d1269c5653972b7829606cf",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1849,
    "chunk_text": "The move comes as Sri Lanka seeks to attract greater international investment and deepen its commercial ties with overseas markets. Access to reliable market intelligence, transparent transaction processes and professional advice remain important for the investors assessing opportunities in emerging markets.\n\nShe added, \u201cOur responsibility extends beyond facilitating transactions. We are committed to helping investors make informed decisions through professional advisory services, transparent practices and internationally benchmarked standards. Through this association, we hope to encourage greater collaboration, promote responsible investment and contribute to strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s position as an attractive investment destination.\u201d\n\nCapital Trust Holdings operates across a diversified portfolio of businesses, including stockbroking, real estate development, real estate transaction and advisory services, education, packaging and wealth management. This cross-sector presence enables the group to engage with the European companies seeking investment, expansion and commercial opportunities in Sri Lanka. For the businesses considering establishing or expanding operations locally, the association offers access to professional guidance on commercial property requirements, location selection and market conditions. The investors exploring residential and income-generating properties can also benefit from local expertise, market insights and structured transaction advisory services.\n\nThe membership further supports Capital Trust Properties\u2019 commitment to strengthening professional standards within Sri Lanka\u2019s real estate industry. The company places emphasis on ethical business practices, due diligence and transparent transactions, while advocating for greater professionalism and accountability across the sector."
