    "chunk_text": "George Steuart & Company Group Chairman Sarva Ameresekere stated, \u201cWe are honoured to welcome James to the board. We believe his vast international experience and understanding of Sri Lanka will be valuable as we strive to explore opportunities beyond our shores. His addition to the board adds further depth and diversity of expertise to support the group\u2019s growth aspirations.\u201d\n\nFounded in 1835 by Captain James Steuart, the group has evolved from Sri Lanka\u2019s oldest mercantile establishment into a diversified group with interests spanning tea exports, healthcare, travel and leisure, financial services, consumer products and industrial solutions.\n\nAs it approaches its bicentenary, the group remains committed to building on its legacy, creating lasting value and shaping a stronger future for generations to come."
