    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the performance, Ramesh Schaffter, Managing Director/Group CEO of Janashakthi PLC (JXG) said, \u201cWe undertook our IPO and commenced our journey as a listed diversified financial services group during a period that subsequently evolved into one of heightened global uncertainty. While current market conditions have not been conducive to reporting the level of earnings we have delivered historically, we remain confident in the strength of our underlying businesses, and continue with implementing our long-term strategy.\u201d\n\nLooking ahead, JXG remains focused on strengthening its core businesses while pursuing targeted opportunities that create sustainable long-term value."
