    "chunk_text": "High Court suspends Namal\u2019s bail in Krrish deal case\n\nThe Colombo High Court today issued an interim order suspending the operation of the bail order granted to MP Namal Rajapaksa by the Colombo Chief Magistrate\u2019s Court in connection with the alleged bribery involving the Krrish deal.\n\nHigh Court Judge Lal Bandara Ranasinghe also ordered that notices be issued to the respondents."
