    "date_str": "2026-11-19",
    "description": "Budget 2027: Can Sri Lanka turn ambition into growth?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Budget-2027-Can-Sri-Lanka-turn-ambition-into-growth/4-800274",
