    "chunk_text": "High Court suspends Namal Rajapaksa\u2019s bail in Krrish case\n\nThe Colombo High Court yesterday issued an interim order suspending the bail granted to Parliamentarian Namal Rajapaksa by the Colombo Chief Magistrate\u2019s Court in the Krrish transaction case, pending the outcome of legal proceedings.\n\nThe order follows a revision application by the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC), challenging the Chief Magistrate\u2019s Court\u2019s decision of 3 November, 2026 to grant Rajapaksa bail. The Commission is seeking to overturn the bail order and have him remanded again."
