    "chunk_text": "In addition to submissions, the platform offers complete visibility and direct support throughout the repair process. The policyholders can review their uploaded files, track approval stages and monitor payment settlements in real time. Whenever questions come up, the customers can message their assigned claim officers directly through a built-in online chat during office hours. For the eligible claims within specified value limits, even the final post-repair inspection can be completed online."
