    "md5": "60a28d4df4fc0edd8ad0404e06ea23f4",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1482,
    "chunk_text": "DFCC Bank-Asia Securities pioneer automated receipts for investor payments\n\nExchange of memorandum of understanding between DFCC Bank Director and Chief Executive Officer Thimal Perera and Asia Securities Chairman Dumith Fernando\n\nNovel solution enables real-time payment processing for Asia Securities\u2019 stockbroking clients\n\nIn a first for Sri Lanka\u2019s stockbroking industry, DFCC Bank and Asia Securities have introduced a solution that enables the payments made to Asia Securities by its clients to be identified and reconciled automatically in real time.\n\nThis solution benefits the clients of Asia Securities by eliminating manual payment verification delays and enabling fast, reliable transactions.\n\nBy connecting DFCC Bank\u2019s collection infrastructure directly with Asia Securities\u2019 systems via a secure application programming interface, the integration assigns a unique virtual account to each client. The incoming payments are then automatically matched and routed to Asia Securities in real time.\n\nDFCC Bank CEO Thimal Perera said, \u201cEfficient capital markets require the movement and reconciliation of funds to be as seamless as the trade itself. By connecting DFCC Bank\u2019s collection infrastructure directly with Asia Securities\u2019 operating platform, we are giving Asia Securities faster visibility of collections, reducing verification delays for investors and creating a foundation for greater speed, scale and confidence across the investment ecosystem.\u201d"
  },
