    "chunk_text": "DFCC Bank CEO Thimal Perera said, \u201cEfficient capital markets require the movement and reconciliation of funds to be as seamless as the trade itself. By connecting DFCC Bank\u2019s collection infrastructure directly with Asia Securities\u2019 operating platform, we are giving Asia Securities faster visibility of collections, reducing verification delays for investors and creating a foundation for greater speed, scale and confidence across the investment ecosystem.\u201d\n\nThe integration supports real-time payment notifications across major deposit and fund-transfer channels, including cash deposits, inward fund transfers, CEFTS, SLIPS and RTGS transactions. Cheque deposits are also captured for automated reconciliation, subject to standard clearing timelines."
