    "chunk_text": "SampathCards offers up to 60% discounts this festive season\n\nA Season Better Spent\u2019 campaign brings exclusive offers and privileges for Sampath credit and debit cardholders until December 31, 2026\n\nSampathCards is making the Christmas and New Year season even more rewarding with an exciting range of exclusive discounts of up to 60 percent for all Sampath credit and debit cardholders.\n\nRunning from November to December 31, 2026, the annual seasonal campaign brings together an extensive portfolio of offers across a diverse network of merchant partners, giving the customers more opportunities to enjoy the festivities while making their seasonal spending go further.\n\nThemed \u2018A Season Better Spent\u2019, the campaign features exclusive discounts and privileges across multiple categories, including retail and fashion, giftware, wellness and watches, footwear, online shopping, eyewear and hearing, auto care, baby and kids, home care, electronics and furniture, travel and leisure, sports, supermarkets, jewellery and dining.\n\nThe extensive selection caters to a variety of festive needs, from finding the perfect gifts for loved ones and preparing homes for the celebrations to enjoying dining, shopping and leisure experiences throughout the holiday season. The cardholders can also benefit from extended settlement plan options, adding greater flexibility to their purchases."
