    "chunk_text": "Minor fire at Inland Revenue Department contained\n\nColombo, Nov. 19 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0A minor fire that broke out in the central air-conditioning system on the ground floor of the Department of Inland Revenue building has been completely brought under control.\n\nThe Department said the incident had not disrupted its official operations and that all activities were continuing as usual."
