    "chunk_size_bytes": 424,
    "chunk_text": "Historic US-China-Russia meeting held\n\nChinese President Xi Jinping, US President Donald Trump and Russian President Vladimir Putin hold a historic trilateral meeting at Kylin Villa, a state guesthouse in Shenzhen, southern China. The leaders were expected to discuss nuclear disarmament, the wars in Iran and Ukraine, and economic cooperation, with Xi calling for \u201cpeaceful coexistence\u201d among the three countries. (CNN)"
