    "chunk_text": "Trevor Mendis joins Softlogic Holdings Board\n\nSoftlogic Holdings PLC has appointed Dr. Trevor Mendis to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nDr. Mendis is a strategist, management consultant, banker and a pracedamic who blends his wealth of hands-on local and global exposure into the corporate world. Presently he works as a Senior Management Consultant and a Member of the Board of Study for the Postgraduate Institute of Management (PIM), University of Sri Jayewardenepura. He also serves as a Senior Independent Director of ODEL PLC and on four Board Sub-Committees.\n\nFrom humble beginnings as a Junior Banker, Dr. Mendis rose through the ranks to Assistant General Manager, Corporate Planning and Business Development and Leasing in the banking industry. He has also worked at ANZ Bank, New Zealand, a Fortune 500 company, and was a Member of the Strategic Planning Committee at ANZ Bank for the North Shore Region of Auckland, New Zealand. He made a paradigm shift from banking to the consultancy and academic arena in 2008 and became the Chief Executive Officer of a private university in Sri Lanka."
