    "chunk_text": "Namal Rajapaksa produced before court in Krrish case\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Remanded MP Namal Rajapaksa was brought before the Colombo Magistrate\u2019s Court today (20) in connection with the Krrish transaction case.\n\nThe case was scheduled to be taken up before the Colombo Magistrate\u2019s Court today, and Rajapaksa was escorted from remand custody to appear before the court for the proceedings."
