    "chunk_size_bytes": 1018,
    "chunk_text": "Victor Ratnayake\u2019s younger brother found dead at Athurugiriya home\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The body of the younger brother of veteran musician Victor Ratnayake was discovered inside his residence in the Boralugoda area of Athurugiriya.\n\nThe deceased was identified as Ratnayake Arachchilage Don Freeman, 65, according to Athurugiriya Police.\n\nPolice investigations have revealed that he was a cameraman by profession and had been living alone at the house.\n\nThe body was discovered after residents in the area alerted police on the afternoon of November 18, following a foul smell emanating from the house.\n\nPolice officers who inspected the premises found the body inside and suspect that he had died approximately two days before it was discovered.\n\nA magisterial inquiry was conducted at the scene by Thalangama Inquirer into Sudden Deaths and Justice of the Peace Premalatha Abeywardena.\n\nThe cause of death has not yet been established, and Athurugiriya Police are conducting further investigations."
