    "chunk_text": "\u2018Rotumba Amila\u2019 to be brought back to Sri Lanka today\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Amila Sampath, alias \u2018Rotumba Amila\u2019, an alleged organised crime figure and drug trafficker arrested by Russian security forces, is scheduled to be brought back to Sri Lanka today (20).\n\nHe is wanted by Sri Lankan authorities over several alleged murders, extortion activities and large-scale drug trafficking operations believed to have been carried out in the Southern Province.\n\nAccording to reports, Sampath had fled the country and gone into hiding before being arrested by Russian security authorities in March 2025."
