    "chunk_text": "Janaki Siriwardena further remanded until December 1\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Colombo Chief Magistrate Asanga S. Bodaragama today ordered the further remand of former Krrish Group Director Janaki Siriwardena until December 1 in connection with the ongoing investigation into alleged financial irregularities relating to the Krrish transaction."
