    "chunk_size_bytes": 1005,
    "chunk_text": "Adding to these concerns were claims in the US media that Iran was preparing to attack the US capital with a crude nuclear bomb. Iran has denied the allegation, while Iranian analysts have dismissed the report as a subterfuge or part of a false-flag operation devised by US and Israeli intelligence agencies to rally support for the war with Iran after the US electorate delivered a strong anti-war message in the midterm elections. Trump now claims that Iran is planning to use biological weapons against Americans.\n\nThe Ukraine war continues, with neither Moscow nor Kyiv willing to compromise. Elsewhere, conflicts in Sudan, Ethiopia and other regions continue as though they are of little concern to the international community.\n\nOne cannot be overly optimistic that the Shenzhen summit communiqu\u00e9 will resonate with the hopes of a peace-starved world and pave the way for peace in West Asia, Ukraine, Africa and elsewhere, thereby ushering in a new world order that brings prosperity to all nations."
