    "md5": "726087ceb6e39f8a0a34d472f3240b26",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1754,
    "chunk_text": "Jaffna Int\u2019l Trade Fair 2027 to kick off on January 29\n\nThe 17th Jaffna International Trade Fair (JITF), Northern Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and most established multi-sector trade exhibition, will be held from January 29 to 31, 2027, at the Muttraweli Ground, Jaffna.\n\nOrganised by Lanka Exhibition & Conference Services in association with the Chamber of Commerce and Industries of Yarlpanam, the JITF continues to serve as a key platform for promoting trade, investment, innovation and business development in the Northern province.\n\nThe exhibition will feature 400+ stalls presenting an extensive range of products, services and advanced technologies across multiple industries.\n\nBuilding on the success of previous editions, the 2027 exhibition is expected to feature more than 400 stalls, showcasing a diverse range of products, services and technologies across industries including construction, automobiles, agriculture, food and beverages, apparel, ICT, education, healthcare, financial services and hotel supplies.\n\nThe previous edition attracted an impressive 96,375 visitors and over 4,500 invited business delegates including corporate leaders, entrepreneurs, investors and industry professionals\n\nThe exhibition provides valuable opportunities for businesses to expand their market presence, introduce new products, establish partnerships and connect with potential customers and investors.\n\nThe JITF also plays an important role in supporting the economic development of Northern Sri Lanka by connecting the local entrepreneurs and SMEs with national businesses, investors and industry stakeholders.\n\nIt serves as an effective platform for business networking, knowledge exchange and exploring emerging commercial opportunities in the region."
