    "chunk_size_bytes": 1086,
    "chunk_text": "The robust 1H results for FY2026/27 position Prime Lands Residencies on a positive earnings trajectory for the 2026/27 financial year. With revenue, gross profit and operating profit all recording year-on-year growth, the company plans to sustain and improve on its operational performance, cost management and financial discipline as it progresses through the second half of the year.\n\nThe company ensures customer interest in its real estate developments remains high by delivering high value projects as promised, for example, the luxurious 43 by the Sea project on Marine Drive; topping-off of Tower Cosmos at The Colombo Border, a 484-unit development, four months ahead of schedule, alongside the rapid advancement of The Seasons Colombo 08.\n\nProjected revenues from the newly launched ultra - luxury development, J\u2019adore Negombo, and other high value projects under - construction such as MON VIE Colombo 05, The Prime Colombo 09, The Golf \u2013 Colombo 08 and The Elizabeth \u2013 Colombo 07, forecast strong earnings potential for Prime Residencies PLC for the foreseeable future."
