    "description": "Sungrow sees Galle battery plant as template for Sri Lanka\u2019s grid storage build-out",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Sungrow-sees-Galle-battery-plant-as-template-for-Sri-Lankas-grid-storage-build-out/215-355384",
    "lang": "en",
