    "chunk_size_bytes": 1707,
    "chunk_text": "People\u2019s Bank named Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Digital Bank at Euromoney Awards\n\nPeople\u2019s Bank has once again reinforced its position as a leader in Sri Lanka\u2019s financial services sector by being named Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Digital Bank at the prestigious Euromoney Awards for Excellence 2026, recognizing its continued commitment to digital transformation, technological innovation and inclusive, customer-centric banking.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Chairman of People\u2019s Bank, Chandana Guniyangoda stated, \u201cWe are honoured to receive this prestigious international recognition, which reaffirms our commitment to digital innovation and transformation. We will continue to come up with novel customer centric digital banking features that conform to the highest standards in security, and governance. People\u2019s Bank is proud to contribute to Sri Lanka\u2019s digital transformation and the nation\u2019s vision of achieving its digital economy goals by 2030.\u201d\n\nChief Executive Officer/General Manager of People\u2019s Bank, Clive Fonseka, added,\u201cOur digital platforms are designed around convenience, security and accessibility. This recognition reflects the trust of millions of customers and the dedication of our employees in making banking simpler, smarter and more inclusive.\u201d\n\nWith a total asset base exceeding Rs. 3.9 trillion and a customer base of over 15.2 million, People\u2019s Bank serves individuals, small and medium-sized enterprises, large corporate and public sector institutions. Its extensive network of 746 branches and service centers ensures a strong presence across the country, connecting customers in both urban and rural communities with a comprehensive range of financial services."
