    "chunk_text": "Army seizes firearm and hunting equipment in \u2018Hasthi Sena\u2019 raid\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0A firearm, elephant tusk fragments, hunting equipment and other items allegedly used for illegal hunting have been seized during a special operation conducted under the Sri Lanka Army-led national \u2018Hasthi Sena\u2019 operation in the Kebithigollewa area.\n\nThe operation was carried out in the Yaan Oya-Wahalkada area, which is frequently visited by a wild elephant known as \u2018Gajabahu\u2019.\n\nDuring the operation, security personnel searched forest areas and residential premises, recovering a muzzle-loading firearm, several cartridges, metal rods used for hunting wild animals, snares set up inside the forest, prepared snares and traps, three elephant tusk fragments, wild animal meat and several pointed knives allegedly used to kill wild animals.\n\nThe national \u2018Hasthi Sena\u2019 operation is being implemented by the Sri Lanka Army on the instructions of Defence Secretary Air Vice Marshal Sampath Thuyacontha (Retd.), with the aim of protecting wild elephants, reducing threats to wildlife and mitigating human-elephant conflict while safeguarding human lives and property.\n\nThe operation is being conducted jointly by the Sri Lanka Army and the Department of Wildlife Conservation under the guidance of the Ministry of Defence and the Ministry of Environment."
