    "chunk_text": "Police seek public help to arrest Ahungalla shooting suspect\n\nColombo, Nov. 20 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Sri Lanka Police have sought public assistance to locate and arrest a suspect wanted in connection with a fatal shooting in Welikanda, Ahungalla.\n\nThe Ahungalla Police are conducting further investigations into the murder, which was committed using a pistol-type firearm on October 1, 2026.\n\nPolice said the suspect had evaded arrest and fled the area. His photograph and personal details have been released to the public to assist in locating him.\n\nThe suspect has been identified as Liyanage Dinesh Suranga, 38, of No. 567/C/1, Welikanda, Ahungalla.\n\nMembers of the public who have information regarding his whereabouts are requested to contact the Officer-in-Charge of the Ahungalla Police Station on 071-8591485 or the police station on 091-2264026.\n\nBrother of underworld figure \u2018Loku Patty\u2019 shot dead in Ahungalla"
