    "chunk_text": "The Trump administration came under scrutiny in recent days after the US witnessed a major tech meltdown as service outages affected not just travel, communications, and e-commerce, but also the National Security Agency.\n\nTop US officials have since sought to assure people in the country that there was no evidence of a cyberattack.\n\nDuring Trump's first stint in the Oval Office, Cairncross took on various roles as a White House insider. He was \u2060also an executive at \u200bthe Republican National Committee before becoming the cybersecurity chief."
