    "chunk_text": "During the meeting, Moragoda briefed Ambassador Wei on the work the Pathfinder Foundation had undertaken in collaboration with numerous Chinese institutions, think tanks, educational and other institutions. Ambassador Wei expressed interest in upgrading Sri Lankan agricultural practices with Chinese know-how, concluding a China-Sri Lanka free trade agreement to facilitate the introduction of new technology and facilitate trade, providing know-how on artificial intelligence, and addressing human-elephant conflict using experience gained from Yunnan Province, among other areas.\n\nMoragoda presented the Chinese Ambassador with a copy of the report on \u2018Colombo Maritime Dialogue\u2019 concluded in May 2026 and a selection of Pathfinder publications, including several translations.\n\nThe year 2026 also saw several exchanges between the Pathfinder Foundation and leading institutions in China, further broadening the scope of engagement.\n\nLooking ahead, 2027 is expected to see further expansion of this relationship, including trilateral cooperation initiatives that bring together the Pathfinder Foundation, Chinese institutions and partners from third countries."
