    "chunk_text": "eChannelling shines at SLIM National Sales Awards 2026\n\neChannelling PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s pioneering digital healthcare platform and subsidiary of Mobitel, celebrated a clean sweep and a historic milestone for the company at the recently concluded Silver Jubilee Edition of the SLIM National Sales Awards 2026. All five eChannelling nominees received awards including two Gold Awards, one Silver Award, and two Bronze Awards at the national event.\n\nThe award winners included Prabath Devapriyal, securing Gold in the Territory Manager category, and Sameera Aponsu, who also won Gold in the Front Liners category, with both emerging as distinguished winners from over 1,400 participants from across the country.\n\nAdditionally, Apeksha Jayawardhana clinched Silver in the Other Sales Support Staff \u2013 Manager category, while Harjun Raj and Amila Silva received Bronze in the Territory Manager and Front Liners categories, respectively in the highly competitive selection process.\n\neChannelling\u2019s 100% success rate at the Silver Jubilee Edition of the SLIM National Sales Awards 2026 represents a testament to the organisation\u2019s depth of talent and commitment to a people-first, performance-driven culture. The awards also differentiate eChannelling from its peers showcasing high-performing professionals who deliver outstanding value to customers, doctors, and medical communities islandwide, the company said."
