    "description": "The Rising Tide of Aging uncovers the Silver Economy in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/The-Rising-Tide-of-Aging-uncovers-the-Silver-Economy-in-Sri-Lanka/172-355426",
