    "chunk_text": "Landslide warnings issued for three districts\n\nColombo, November 21 (Daily Mirror)- The National Building Research Institute (NBRI) has issued landslide warnings for vulnerable areas in three districts, effective until 5 a.m. tomorrow (22).\n\nAmber-level warnings have been issued for Yatinuwara in Kandy district, Mawanella in Kegalle district while yellow-level warnining has been issued for Ambagamuwa in Nuwara Eliya district.\n\nThe NBRI has warned that persistent rainfall could trigger landslides, slope failures, rockfalls and ground subsidence in the affected areas."
