    "chunk_text": "Fire breaks out at scrap metal shop in Pannipitiya\n\nColombo, November 21 (Daily Mirror)- A fire broke out at a scrap metal shop in Depanama, Pannipitiya, this morning, police said.\n\nThree fire engines from the Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte Municipal Council have been dispatched to the scene to bring the blaze under control.\n\nPolice confirmed that no casualties have been reported so far.\n\nThe cause of the fire remains unknown, while Maharagama Police are conducting further investigations into the incident."
