    "chunk_text": "Browns Deals brings world-class entertainment home this World Television Day\n\nThirty years after United Nations proclaimed World Television Day, Browns Deals celebrates screen at heart of every Sri Lankan home\n\nIn 1996, the United Nations proclaimed November 21 as the World Television Day, recognising the television\u2019s power to inform, educate and connect people across the world.\n\nThirty years on, the television has changed beyond recognition. Smart connectivity, built-in streaming, 4K picture quality, voice control and immersive sound have made today\u2019s TV the centrepiece of the modern home, bringing families together for live sport, blockbuster films, news and educational content.\n\nThis World Television Day, Browns Deals celebrates the role television plays in everyday life, while making the latest TV technology from leading global brands accessible to households across Sri Lanka.\n\nAs one of Sri Lanka\u2019s trusted destinations for consumer electronics and home appliances, Browns Deals offers televisions from LG, Samsung, Sharp, Sanford, Aiwa and Orel, ranging from 32-inch HD models to 75-inch 4K screens. The collection includes Full HD and 4K UHD Smart TVs as well as QLED and NanoCell models, with options to suit every room and every budget. Prices start from Rs.32,990 for the Sanford 32-inch HD LED TV, which comes with a two-year Browns warranty.\n\nCustomers can explore the full range at www.brownsdeals.com, where they can compare the models side by side, read customer reviews and check detailed specifications before they buy.\n\nFlexible payment options include KOKO, MintPay and instalment plans with leading banks.\n\nBrowns Deals also offers islandwide delivery, free delivery within Colombo 01 to 15, a seven-day return policy and a customer helpline available round the clock on 077 388 8885/ 077 369 8795.\n\nCustomers who prefer to shop in person can visit the Browns Centre on Darley Road, Colombo 10 or take a tour of the Browns Deals Virtual Store online."
  },
