    "chunk_text": "Browns Deals also offers islandwide delivery, free delivery within Colombo 01 to 15, a seven-day return policy and a customer helpline available round the clock on 077 388 8885/ 077 369 8795.\n\nCustomers who prefer to shop in person can visit the Browns Centre on Darley Road, Colombo 10 or take a tour of the Browns Deals Virtual Store online.\n\n\u201cThis World Television Day, we are proud to help Sri Lankan families access the latest innovations in television technology, with exceptional value and convenience.\u201d\n\nEstablished in 1875, Browns has grown into one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading diversified conglomerates, with interests spanning automotive, power generation, agriculture and plantations, pharmaceuticals, manufacturing, marine, investments and leisure. Building on this legacy of trust, Browns Deals continues to deliver quality products and dependable after-sales service, supported by its dedicated Electronics Care Centre, to households across the island.\n\nThis World Television Day, discover the latest television offers at www.brownsdeals.com or in-store at Darley Road and bring home the perfect screen for every moment.\n\nThe prices are correct at the time of print and are subject to change."
