    "chunk_text": "Diesel leak reported at Bloemendhal Fuel Storage Terminal\n\nColombo, Nov 21 ( Daily Mirror): A diesel leak was reported at the Bloemendhal Fuel Storage Terminal this morning (21), causing fuel to flow out through the facility\u2019s drainage system.\n\nFollowing the leak, residents in the surrounding area were seen gathering at the site with buckets and cans to collect the diesel that had flowed through the drains."
