    "description": "Parliamentary Committee calls for proper recycling and disposal of electric vehicle batteries",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Parliamentary-Committee-calls-for-proper-recycling-and-disposal-of-electric-vehicle-batteries/108-355480",
    "lang": "en",
