    "chunk_text": "Workers\u2019 protests planned for tomorrow, strikes on November 30\n\nColombo, Nov. 22 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Workers\u2019 Struggle Centre has announced plans to hold protests in front of government institutions and workplaces tomorrow (23), followed by sector-based strikes on November 30.\n\nThe centre said one-day strikes would be held in certain sectors, while workers in other sectors would stage two-day strikes.\n\nIt warned that further trade union action would be launched if the Government failed to respond adequately to workers\u2019 grievances.\n\nThe centre said it was prepared to mobilise workers for broader action to protect workers\u2019 rights and oppose what it described as injustices against the people."
