    "chunk_size_bytes": 540,
    "chunk_text": "DMT assures uninterrupted services despite cyber attack\n\nColombo, Nov. 22 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Department of Motor Traffic (DMT) has assured the public that its services will continue without interruption despite a cyber attack targeting its official website last night.\n\nThe Department has advised the public to continue making appointments through its online portal at https://dmtappointments.dmt.gov.lk or by contacting its hotline on 0112 117 116.\n\nThe DMT had earlier announced that its official website had come under a cyber attack."
  },
