    "chunk_size_bytes": 735,
    "chunk_text": "Severe lightning warning issued for multiple areas\n\nColombo, Nov. 22 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Department of Meteorology has issued an Amber-level weather advisory warning of severe lightning in several parts of the country.\n\nAccording to the advisory, thundershowers accompanied by severe lightning are expected in parts of the Ampara, Badulla, Colombo, Galle, Hambantota, Kalutara, Kandy, Kegalle, Kurunegala, Matale, Matara, Monaragala, Nuwara Eliya and Ratnapura districts.\n\nThe Department warned that the risk of severe lightning would be higher during thundershowers, particularly in the evening and night.\n\nThe public has been urged to take necessary precautions to minimise the potential damage and risks associated with lightning."
