    "description": "Lankan elected Asia-Pacific Association of Agricultural Research Institutions President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Lankan-elected-Asia-Pacific-Association-of-Agricultural-Research-Institutions-President/34-800442",
