    "chunk_size_bytes": 1529,
    "chunk_text": "One of the most defining expressions of this vision is the property\u2019s iconic infinity pool, designed to create a seamless visual connection between the pool, the Indian Ocean and the sky. Its disappearing edge captures Bawa\u2019s philosophy of dissolving the boundaries between architecture and nature, an experience that remains as striking today as it was when the hotel first opened. The anniversary theme, \u201845 to Infinity\u2019, draws inspiration from this architectural landmark, connecting the property\u2019s 45-year heritage with an endless horizon of possibilities.\n\nThe property\u2019s architectural significance extends beyond its visual appeal. It represents an important chapter in Sri Lanka\u2019s design heritage and continues to attract guests, architects and design enthusiasts eager to experience Bawa\u2019s approach to Tropical Modernism. Through its anniversary celebrations, Heritance Ahungalla will bring this legacy to life with architectural storytelling, guided experiences and a dedicated content series exploring the distinctive design elements found throughout the property.\n\nBeyond its architecture, the story of Heritance Ahungalla is equally one of people, relationships and shared experiences. Over the past 45 years, the property has welcomed generations of travellers, celebrated personal milestones and offered individuals the opportunity to build lasting careers in hospitality. Its team members, including those who have dedicated decades of service to the hotel, remain an integral part of its identity."
