    "description": "Beyond the Obvious: SLID and Frankfurt School of Finance and Management to present executive program on risk management",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Beyond-the-Obvious-SLID-and-Frankfurt-School-of-Finance-and-Management-to-present-executive-program-on-risk-management/34-800471",
    "lang": "en",
