    "chunk_text": "Phuangketkeow said the agreement would significantly contribute to promoting tourism between the two countries and strengthening business ties.\n\nHe also said Thailand's ready to provide technical assistance to Sri Lanka, particularly in the agricultural sector, when needed.\n\nPhuangketkeow also invited President Dissanayake to undertake an official visit to Thailand in the near future.\n\nThe meeting was attended by senior Sri Lankan and Thai government officials, including Secretary to the President Dr Nandika Sanath Kumanayake and Thai Ambassador to Sri Lanka Paitoon Mahapannaporn."
