    "description": "Price of Looking Powerful: Trump\u2019s Uneasy Summit in Shenzhen",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Price-of-Looking-Powerful-Trumps-Uneasy-Summit-in-Shenzhen/172-355519",
