    "description": "Balancing Security and Rights:  The Evolution of Sri Lanka\u2019s Anti-Terrorism Framework",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Balancing-Security-and-Rights-The-Evolution-of-Sri-Lankas-Anti-Terrorism-Framework/172-355526",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
