    "chunk_size_bytes": 880,
    "chunk_text": "Renovated Galadari unveils new Radisson Blu identity\n\nColombo, Nov. 23 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Galadari Hotel in Colombo Fort has been rebranded as the \u2018Radisson Blu Hotel Galadari Colombo\u2019 following an extensive renovation and upgrading programme.\n\nThe hotel's new brand was officially unveiled yesterday under the patronage of Minister of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism Vijitha Herath.\n\nThe renovated hotel features outdoor swimming pools, a spa, fitness facilities, conference and banquet halls, restaurants and bars.\n\nListed on the Colombo Stock Exchange, the hotel said the unveiling of its new brand marked a significant milestone in its transformation process.\n\nThe hotel is scheduled to become fully operational by December.\n\nA large gathering of officials and representatives from the hospitality and tourism sectors attended the brand launch ceremony."
