    "md5": "3040ba06caf1aa9926fda8b7c2799f94",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1700,
    "chunk_text": "Softlogic Life puts Sri Lanka on the map as Asia\u2019s benchmark for Digital and AI insurance\n\nSoftlogic Life emerged as one of the most recognised insurers in Asia at the 30th Asia Insurance Industry Awards (AIIA) 2026, winning both \u2018Digital Insurer of the Year\u2019 and \u2018Technology and AI Initiative of the Year\u2019.\n\nSoftlogic Life was the only organisation shortlisted amongst the top 3 in four categories which also included \u2018Best Life Insurer\u2019 and \u2018Best Health Insurer\u2019 in Asia, placing a Sri Lankan insurer at the forefront of a field that included some of the region\u2019s largest insurance groups.\n\nThe awards were presented on 2 November in Singapore. Organised by Asia Insurance Review, the milestone 30th edition attracted almost 185 entries across 16 categories, from which 49 finalists were shortlisted. Softlogic Life featured in four award categories and converted 50 percent of its nominations into wins.\n\nSoftlogic Life was named Digital Insurer of the Year ahead of Asia\u2019s leading insurers such as Muang Thai Life Assurance of Thailand and Go Digit General Insurance of India. It secured Technology and AI Initiative of the Year from a shortlist that included HSBC Life Singapore, Techcom Life of Vietnam and Go Digit General Insurance.\n\nThe Company was also a finalist for Life Insurance and Health Insurance Company of the Year, alongside Asia\u2019s Fubon Life Insurance, HSBC Life and Nan Shan Life Insurance.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Softlogic Life Managing Director Iftikar Ahamed said, \u201cThis recognition validates something we have believed for many years: digital transformation creates value only when it fundamentally improves the experience of insurance.\u201d"
  },
