    "chunk_text": "Commenting on the achievement, Softlogic Life Managing Director Iftikar Ahamed said, \u201cThis recognition validates something we have believed for many years: digital transformation creates value only when it fundamentally improves the experience of insurance.\u201d\n\nSoftlogic Life EVP/ Chief Digital Innovation Officer Saranga Wijayarathne added, \u201cDeploying more than 300 AI agents and workflows is not only a technology milestone; it is a cultural one. Every agent represents a team that chose to rethink how its work gets done, from underwriting and claims to servicing and finance. The biggest shift has been in mindset.\u201d The AIIA judging process is independently scrutinized by KPMG and includes scoring by a panel of senior insurance\u00a0 leaders from across the region."
