    "chunk_size_bytes": 1829,
    "chunk_text": "BYD with JKCG Auto opens Jaffna 3S facility\n\nBYD, the number one brand in the brand-new new energy vehicle (NEV) segment in Sri Lanka and the world\u2019s leading NEV manufacturer, together with its authorised distributor in Sri Lanka John Keells CG Auto (JKCG Auto) has announced the launch of its Jaffna 3S facility\n\nBYD is the only NEV brand with a 3S facility in the Northern province, offering sales, service and spare parts under one roof.\n\nLocated at the official BYD Jaffna showroom, No. 7, Ariyalai East Road, Ariyalai, Jaffna, the facility brings customers in the North the complete BYD ownership experience close to home.\n\nIt features a showroom displaying BYD\u2019s NEV lineup, including ATTO 1, ATTO 2, DOLPHIN, SEALION 6, SEALION 5, SEALION 8, RACCO, SHARK 6, a fully equipped service centre and a dedicated genuine spare parts inventory.\n\nThe BYD Jaffna showroom is established in partnership with A9 Motors. Led by Director Kuwait Theivendran, A9 Motors brings experience and an established presence in Jaffna\u2019s automotive industry, which will strengthen BYD\u2019s customer reach and engagement across the Northern province.\n\nTheivendran said, \u201cJaffna\u2019s customers are increasingly looking at new energy vehicles and they want the assurance of a brand with sales, service and genuine parts in their own city. As a Jaffna-based dealer, we take that responsibility seriously. Our aim is to make owning a BYD simple and worry-free for every family and business in the North and to be a partner they can rely on for years to come.\u201d\n\nThe opening is another significant milestone in JKCG Auto\u2019s journey of expanding BYD\u2019s islandwide presence, ensuring that the customers in the North can buy, service and maintain their vehicles with the same standards of quality and care as customers anywhere else in the country."
