    "chunk_text": "Gardiner Group Director Investments and M&A Seshaan Gardiner said, \u201cOur heritage is in hospitality but our vision extends well beyond the traditional hotel experience, as we see significant opportunities to invest in Sri Lanka\u2019s evolving leisure and lifestyle landscape. The Pickle Island represents one of several strategic investments we intend to make as we expand into new sectors, create meaningful experiences and build on our long-term confidence in Sri Lanka\u2019s potential, both for those who call it home and those who visit.\u201d\n\nThe new partnership will support its next phase of growth through wider access, new opportunities, sporting related social events and community-focused initiatives.\n\nRonali and Dilshan will remain closely involved, helping preserve the identity and ethos on which the business has been built.\n\nde Silva said, \u201cSport has the ability to bring people together. I look forward to supporting The Pickle Island as it continues to grow and create more opportunities for people to participate.\u201d\n\nThis investment marks a significant step in Gardiner Group\u2019s broader strategy to expand its presence in Sri Lanka\u2019s leisure sector. Building on its established hospitality portfolio, the group is pursuing new opportunities across leisure and lifestyle, with a focus on creating experiences that appeal to both Sri Lankans and international visitors."
