    "chunk_text": "Beyond the table, EKHO has partnered with operator Belihuloya Safari on customisable packages to Nonpareil Estate and Baker\u2019s Bend, each taking in two or three points of interest.\n\nStargazing, signature dining and in time, glamping on the grounds are also in the pipeline.\n\nThe cycling groups riding from Bandarawela down to Avissawella have already begun using the hotel as a rest stop, with more groups due this month, according to Hamid.\n\nEKHO is also working closely with the Sri Lanka Tourism Development Authority, which has its own plan to uplift Belihuloya. The property is being grouped with EKHO\u2019s Ella and Kithulgala hotels under an EKHO Adventure banner, pitched at specialist adventure travel agents.\n\nIf Belihuloya is to become the next Ella, those shaping it would rather it did not become another Ella. For now, the hotel\u2019s ambition is to be the reason the travellers stop driving past.\n\n\u201cFor us, it\u2019s more of promoting the destination and making this place a hub for people to come and stay when visiting Belihuloya,\u201d Hamid said."
