    "chunk_text": "Colombo\u2013Kandy main road to close for seven hours tonight\n\nColombo, Nov. 23 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0The Colombo\u2013Kandy main road will be temporarily closed at Lower Kadugannawa from 11.00 p.m. today (23) until 6.00 a.m. tomorrow (24), the Disaster Management Centre (DMC) announced.\n\nThe seven-hour closure is necessary to remove hazardous rocks at risk of falling onto the road and carry out related maintenance work in the Lower Kadugannawa area, the DMC said.\n\nThe District Disaster Management Unit has informed the District Secretary and other relevant officials about the planned closure.\n\nThe DMC\u2019s Emergency Operations Centre has also notified all relevant parties to ensure the necessary arrangements are made ahead of the closure."
