    "chunk_text": "Harsha proposes Asian Ocean concept\n\nColombo, Nov. 23 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Opposition MP Harsha de Silva's in Parliament today proposed the declaration of an Asian Ocean amalgamating the Indian and Pacific Oceans.\n\nThe MP said Sri Lanka should work with both China, India and others in the region."
