    "chunk_size_bytes": 499,
    "chunk_text": "Aruni Ranaraja to be appointed as Sri Lanka\u2019s Ambassador to US\n\nColombo, Nov. 23 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Foreign Affairs Ministry Secretary Aruni Ranaraja is set to be appointed as Sri Lanka\u2019s first female Ambassador to the United States, Foreign Minister Vijitha Herath informed Parliament today.\n\nAddressing the House, the Minister also assured that suitably qualified individuals will shortly be appointed to fill remaining diplomatic vacancies at other Sri Lankan missions abroad, including China."
