    "chunk_text": "Not for a king. Not for a conqueror. Not for another name to be carved upon the monuments of political vanity.\n\nIt is calling for justice. For reconciliation. For decency. For a republic in which the humblest citizen may stand upright without fear before the mightiest institution of the State."
