    "description": "From Colombo\u2019s floods to climate finance: Wake-up call for Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-Colombo-s-floods-to-climate-finance-Wake-up-call-for-Sri-Lanka/4-800497",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
