    "chunk_text": "Illegally assembled jeep seized in Bandarawela\n\nColombo, November 24 (Daily Mirror)- The Gampaha Division Criminal Investigation Bureau has arrested a suspect and seized a jeep allegedly imported into Sri Lanka without paying the required customs duties and later assembled locally.\n\nThe suspect was arrested by a team of officers from the Gampaha Division Criminal Investigation Bureau on November 19 in connection with the incident.\n\nAs part of the ongoing investigation, police yesterday took the jeep into custody in the Bandarawela area after uncovering further information about the suspect and the vehicle.\n\nFurther investigations into the incident are being carried out by the Gampaha Division Criminal Investigation Bureau."
  },
