    "description": "The Elephant  Doesn\u2019t Need Us\u2026  We Need the Elephant",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/news-features/The-Elephant-Doesnt-Need-Us-We-Need-the-Elephant/131-355609",
