    "md5": "fc8a90e3d33bb9e18ea186316c772c5b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1833,
    "chunk_text": "AIA shines at 17th National Forum for Life Insurance Advisors\n\nAIA Insurance Lanka celebrates the notable achievements of its Wealth Planners who received national recognitionat the National Forum for Life Insurance Advisors (NAFLIA) Life Insurance Industry Sales Awards 2025, organised by the Insurance Association of Sri Lanka (IASL).\n\nDemonstrating AIA\u2019s commitment to nurturing excellence and professionalism within the life insurance industry, AIA representatives secured accolades across both national and company categories at the prestigious awards ceremony.\n\nG. Ravi Kumar Perera, Senior District Wealth Planners\u2019 Manager of ADO \u2013 Panadura City, received the Silver Award for Best Supervisor (National Level) and the Silver Award for Best Supervisor (Company Category \u2013 Large).\n\nAdding to AIA\u2019s success, Sanjeewani Somarathna, District Wealth Planning Manager of Area Development Office \u2013 Kandy, was recognised with the Bronze Award for Best Advisor (National Level) and the Bronze Award for Best Advisor (Company Category \u2013 Large).\n\nChamilka Sarangi, Insurance Advisor of Matara Metro RDO 1, received the Silver Award for Fast Starter Advisor (Company Category \u2013 Large). These achievements highlight outstanding leadershipand commitment to developing high-performing advisors while supporting the growth of the industry.\n\nDirector/Chief Executive Officer of AIA Insurance Lanka, Chathuri Munaweera extended her congratulations to the winners, stating, \u201cSeeing our Wealth Planners and agency leaders honoured at NAFLIA 2026 is a proud moment for AIA. This recognition reflects the high standards of professionalism and customer focus that sit at the heart of our culture. We congratulate all those recognised and look forward to seeing them continue to set new benchmarks of excellence for the industry.\u201d"
