    "md5": "4a24e4b97ae2ee20d6f7030c6891f4ea",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1232,
    "chunk_text": "PayMedia wins Sustainable FinTech Innovation Award\n\nPayMedia (Pvt) Ltd has been recognised for its excellence in financial technology innovation, securing the Winner Award in the Sustainable FinTech Innovation category at FinTech Festival 2026, held at Shangri-La, Colombo on 3 November.\n\nThis recognition was awarded to PayMedia for its Digital Banking Solution, highlighting the company\u2019s continued commitment to developing innovative digital financial services that support a more inclusive, accessible, and sustainable financial ecosystem.\n\nPayMedia\u2019s Digital Banking Solution is designed to support financial institutions in delivering modern digital banking experiences while contributing to the advancement of a more connected and technology-enabled financial ecosystem.\n\nThe award recognises the solution\u2019s contribution to sustainable FinTech innovation and reinforces the company\u2019s role in driving meaningful technological advancements within the industry.\n\nCommenting on this achievement, PayMedia highlighted that the recognition represents the collective dedication, expertise, and collaborative efforts of its talented team, alongside the continued trust and support of its valued clients and business partners."
