    "chunk_text": "HighVoltagePR Managing Director Supun Dias said, \u201cExecuting an influencer campaign at this scale requires more than just volume \u2013 it demands precision, alignment, and real-time agility. Managing over 130 creators and affiliates simultaneously for Sri Lanka\u2019s largest e-commerce event demonstrates how far our digital capabilities have evolved over the past decade. By pairing authentic creator voices with data-backed campaign management, we are delivering measurable visibility and strong consumer engagement at every stage of the 11.11 sale.\u201d\n\nDaraz Sri Lanka Managing Director Rukshan Xavier added, \u201c11.11 is the defining moment of the year for online retail in Sri Lanka, and connecting with shoppers through trusted, relatable voices is central to its success. As we celebrate a decade of Daraz, HighVoltagePR has brought structure, scale, and speed to our creator ecosystem this season, helping us translate widespread social buzz into meaningful customer activity across the platform.\u201d"
