    "md5": "8d17046f1825de63ced13700923a5ddc",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 830,
    "chunk_text": "GRI wins Silver for cleaner production\n\nGlobal Rubber Industries (GRI) has won the Silver award in the Tyre Industry Sector \u2013 Manufacturing Large Category at the National Cleaner Production Awards 2026, organized by the National Cleaner Production Centre Sri Lanka.\n\nThe awards recognize organizations demonstrating excellence in Resource-Efficient and Cleaner Production (RECP) practices. Assessment covers energy and water efficiency, waste minimization, pollution prevention, resource conservation, circular economy practices and sustainable product development - areas that place the practical decisions behind production in the spotlight.\n\nFor GRI, the Silver Award marks a milestone in its journey. It highlights the importance of looking beyond the finished tyre to the processes, people and everyday decisions behind it."
  },
