    "md5": "68e365e063d023abae075eb333b9698c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1998,
    "chunk_text": "InfluencerEffect Campaign Studio launched to transform influencer marketing in SL\n\nInfluencer marketing in Sri Lanka is set to take a strategic leap with the launch of InfluencerEffect Campaign Studio, a collaboration between Dr. Darshana Jayasinghe, Director/CEO of InfluencerEffect and Afficacy Growth Lab, and Hashan Gunasekara, Founder/CEO of Sekara Production Creative.\n\nThe partnership aims to transform influencer marketing from a tactical promotional activity into a strategic business investment, combining marketing expertise, influencer selection, creative production and campaign execution.\n\nThe collaboration was formalised through an exchange of agreements at Sekara Production Creative\u2019s head office on 04 November 2026, with business engagements commencing from 11 November.\n\nWhile influencer marketing continues to grow, many businesses still approach campaigns primarily through content creation, social media visibility and follower numbers. The partnership seeks to address this gap by connecting campaign objectives with strategic planning, audience relevance, influencer credibility and measurable business outcomes.\n\nInsights from \u2018Trend Eka\u2019, Sri Lanka\u2019s first influencer marketing podcast initiated by InfluencerEffect, have highlighted the need for stronger alignment among marketers, advertising agencies, brands and digital content creators.\n\nDr. Jayasinghe, a business and marketing consultant with over two decades of experience, brings strategic advisory expertise and doctoral research in influencer marketing, including a strategic influencer selection and evaluation model. His role will focus on campaign strategy, influencer selection, brand alignment and performance measurement, helping businesses move beyond popularity-based decisions towards meaningful influence.\n\nSekara Production Creative will contribute its expertise in digital video, film production, creative development and campaign management, supported by influencer marketing specialists."
  },
