    "md5": "e6debb83eb70eb0965921f7625988397",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1490,
    "chunk_text": "Dr. Jayasinghe, a business and marketing consultant with over two decades of experience, brings strategic advisory expertise and doctoral research in influencer marketing, including a strategic influencer selection and evaluation model. His role will focus on campaign strategy, influencer selection, brand alignment and performance measurement, helping businesses move beyond popularity-based decisions towards meaningful influence.\n\nSekara Production Creative will contribute its expertise in digital video, film production, creative development and campaign management, supported by influencer marketing specialists.\n\nCommenting on the collaboration, Dr. Jayasinghe said, \u201cInfluencer marketing is no longer just about creating content. It is about creating influence that delivers business impact. Our ambition is to help businesses connect strategy with creativity and invest in influencer marketing more meaningfully.\u201d\n\nGunasekara added, \u201cQuality creative production becomes more powerful when supported by a clear strategy. This collaboration brings together creative excellence and influencer marketing expertise to deliver stronger value for brands.\u201d\n\nInfluencerEffect Campaign Studio will serve established brands, marketing teams, SMEs, MSMEs and advertising agencies seeking integrated influencer marketing solutions.\n\nThe initiative will also create opportunities for creators to participate in professionally planned campaigns and develop meaningful brand partnerships."
