    "md5": "04ba9607cd23d838c9acb903618bc2c2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1792,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Life celebrates multiple wins at National Sales Awards 2026\n\nHNB Life PLC marked another significant achievement at the National Sales Awards 2026, where seven members of its team were honoured for excellence in sales and sales support.\n\nThe recognition highlights the outstanding contributions made by the company\u2019s professionals, whose efforts continue to make a meaningful impact on customers and communities across Sri Lanka.\n\nAmong the winners, Chamara Gunarathna secured a Bronze Award in the Sales Supervisor Category, while Iresha Maduwanthi received a Bronze Award in the Front Liner Category and Niranji Wijesinghe was recognized with a Bronze Award in the Other Sales Support Staff (Assistant Manager) Category.\n\nMerit Awards were earned by Chathuranga Sandaruwan in the Front Liner Category, Sandali Lekamge and Sachin Subasinghe in the Sales Supervisor Category, and Senthurupan Velauthapillai in the Territory Manager Category.\n\nThese accolades earned by HNB Life\u2019s professionals demonstrate the pivotal role they play in helping customers secure their financial futures while contributing to the growth of the life insurance industry in Sri Lanka.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, HNB Life\u2019s Executive Director / CEO Lasitha Wimalaratne said, \u201cWe are proud of our award winners and delighted to see their hard work and dedication being recognized on a national platform.\n\nThese achievements are a testament not only to individual excellence but also to the culture of learning, collaboration and customer-centricity that defines HNB Life. On behalf of the entire organization, I extend my heartfelt congratulations to each winner for this remarkable accomplishment. Their success inspires us all and reflects the high standards we continue to uphold as a company.\u201d"
  },
