    "description": "Sri Lanka temporarily allows travelers to board flights without an ETA",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Sri-Lanka-temporarily-allows-travelers-to-board-flights-without-an-ETA/108-355649",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
