    "description": "Growth deadlock: Diagnosing Sri Lanka\u2019s detour from knowledge economy and charting the way forward - Part I",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Growth-deadlock-Diagnosing-Sri-Lanka-s-detour-from-knowledge-economy-and-charting-the-way-forward-Part-I/4-800513",
