    "description": "Cabinet clears $ 5.12 m procurement of cardiac and diabetes medicines",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Cabinet-clears-5-12-m-procurement-of-cardiac-and-diabetes-medicines/34-800541",
    "lang": "en",
