    "md5": "cb47686a3f68a12dbce16fbda06c6f24",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1888,
    "chunk_text": "Pope Francis\u2019 private notes reveal visions of the devil and a plan to allow married men to be priests\n\nyahoo news - Pope Francis had three visions of the devil in his life. He described them in notes discovered by Argentine cardinal V\u00edctor Manuel Fern\u00e1ndez and published this Tuesday in a book entitled Il diario personale di Papa Francesco (Libreria vaticana edizioni).\n\n\"I recalled three definite episodes in which I do not doubt that he appeared physically\", read the writings of Pope Francis, previewed by several Italian newspapers. \"He stared at me with eyes of fire.\"\n\nThe book, which is being published in five languages in 94 countries, brings together diaries, notes and documents dated between 1992 and 2024, which were in a box found by the current Prefect of the Dicastery for the Doctrine of the Faith, who is also Argentine, like Pope Francis.\n\nPope Francis, born Jos\u00e9 Mario Bergoglio, had his first vision of the devil as a bishop in Buenos Aires claiming \"I saw him from the car window. I do not forget his eyes, threatening and at the same time seductive\".\n\nA \"look\" Bergoglio said he would never forget. The second encounter, when he was still in Argentina, was \"stronger than the previous one\".\n\n\"He looked at me with eyes of fire. I do not forget that look\", the description states. \"They were like rays of fire. Then he tried to come closer and I ran away, clutching the Rosary and pleading with the Virgin [Mary, mother of Jesus]... Curiosity struggled against the Rosary. And the Virgin saved me.\"\n\nThe third encounter took place in January 2021, when he was already leading the Church.\n\n\"During a meeting, I saw him and heard his voice, triumphant, master of everything: \"Now I have obtained everything I wanted\", the pontiff noted.\n\n\"I cannot forget the powerful rasp of his voice. The Lord gave me the opportunity to leave that meeting and so I was freed.\""
  },
