    "chunk_text": "Vasudeva Nanayakkara arrives at CIABOC\n\nColombo, Nov. 25 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Former Minister Vasudeva Nanayakkara arrived at the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) a short while ago to provide a statement.\n\nHe was summoned to the Commission to record a statement as part of an investigation."
