    "description": "\u2018Suwa Husma\u2019 Every Breath Matters: People\u2019s Leasing leads a national call for healthier lungs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Suwa-Husma-Every-Breath-Matters-Peoples-Leasing-leads-a-national-call-for-healthier-lungs/215-355691",
