    "md5": "6f2a7c1362df49cfe4740b814158e20c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1700,
    "chunk_text": "\u2018Suwa Husma\u2019 Every Breath Matters: People\u2019s Leasing leads a national call for healthier lungs\n\nAs a responsible corporate citizen, People\u2019s Leasing & Finance PLC remains steadfast in its commitment to creating meaningful and lasting change in the communities it serves, going beyond its role as a leading financial services provider to contribute towards building a healthier, stronger and more sustainable nation.\n\nReaffirming this commitment, the company launched the special initiative \u2018Suwa Husma\u2019 on November 24, to raise awareness about lung diseases, promote respiratory health and encourage people to embrace healthier lifestyles, under the message of \u2018Every Breath Matters.- Healthy Lungs, Healthy Life\u2019.\n\nAs an important step in taking this message beyond conventional awareness campaigns and into the wider community, the Sri Lanka College of Pulmonological (SLCP) will serve as the principal medical and technical partner of the Every Breath Matters initiative, bringing essential medical expertise, professional credibility and national healthcare experience to the campaign.\n\nAs an initiative awareness idea, People\u2019s Leasing has dedicated its 2026 annual calendar to this important theme, using it as a creative communication platform to bring the message of lung health and disease prevention into homes, workplaces and communities across the country. This initiative marks the beginning of a series of community-focused programmes and awareness campaigns the company has lined up, with the broader objective of educating the public, encouraging preventive healthcare and supporting national efforts to safeguard the well-being of the present and future generations."
  },
