    "md5": "beb0aea9fe2816f6395932e234ba471a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1731,
    "chunk_text": "Browns Hotels & Resorts wins multiple national accolades\n\nCalm Resort & Spa and Dickwella Resort & Spa receive recognition at Presidential Environment Awards and National Cleaner Production Awards 2026\n\nBrowns Hotels & Resorts has earned national recognition at two prominent award ceremonies in 2026 for its continued commitment to environmental responsibility and sustainable hospitality.\n\nTwo of its coastal properties, The Calm Resort & Spa in Pasikudah and Dickwella Resort & Spa, received accolades at Presidential Environment Awards and National Cleaner Production Awards 2026.\n\nAt Presidential Environment Awards 2026, The Calm Resort & Spa received a Bronze award, while Dickwella Resort & Spa was presented with a Merit award in the Industry Sector \u2013 Hotels Type A & B Category.\n\nFurther strengthening this achievement, both properties were also recognised at National Cleaner Production Awards 2026 in the Service Sector \u2013 Hotel Medium Category, acknowledging their efforts towards adopting cleaner production practices and integrating greater environmental responsibility into their operations.\n\nTogether, these recognitions highlight the practical measures undertaken at both properties to minimise their environmental footprint while maintaining responsible hospitality operations. Initiatives spanning energy efficiency, responsible water consumption, waste management, coastal conservation and community engagement form part of their ongoing efforts to operate more sustainably.\n\nThe achievements at both properties reflect the leadership and commitment of The Calm Resort & Spa General Manager Sujeewa Basnayake and Dickwella Resort & Spa General Manager Sisira Senaratne, together with their respective teams."
  },
