    "chunk_text": "The achievements at both properties reflect the leadership and commitment of The Calm Resort & Spa General Manager Sujeewa Basnayake and Dickwella Resort & Spa General Manager Sisira Senaratne, together with their respective teams.\n\nThese property-level initiatives are also part of a broader sustainability vision taking shape across Browns Hotels & Resorts through BIGG CARE, the group\u2019s sustainability framework built around green governance, climate action, accountability, resource efficiency and engagement. Recently, the Group took another significant step in formalising this commitment with the launch of its Sustainability Programme and Policy, establishing a more structured approach to embedding responsible practices across its operations.\n\nBrowns Hotels & Resorts Assistant Manager Sustainability and CSR Prabuddha Siriwardhana said, \u201cSustainability becomes meaningful when commitments translate into everyday practices. Through BIGG CARE, we are working towards bringing greater accountability and consistency to our sustainability efforts across the group. Our focus now is to build on this momentum and continue driving measurable improvements across our operations.\u201d"
