    "md5": "be1c858b123fbc22921db4f74272478e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1863,
    "chunk_text": "ComBank rewards Transact More & Win Big campaign winners\n\nFrom left: Commercial Bank Digital Banking Unit senior management representatives present an iPhone Duo, the first monthly grand prize in Transact More & Win Big campaign, to the winner and her family\n\niPhone 18, Galaxy Z Fold8 up for grabs at upcoming monthly draws\n\nCommercial Bank of Ceylon PLC is accelerating its \u2018Digital by Default\u2019 strategy with a high-value tech giveaway this festive season.\n\nThe first batch of winners in the bank\u2019s year-end digital banking promotion has received an exciting array of prizes, highlighted by the selection of the grand winner of the Apple iPhone Duo, a first-of-its-kind giveaway by a bank in Sri Lanka, as the bank steps up its efforts to encourage the customers to make greater use of digital payments. Launched on October 1, under the theme \u2018Transact More and Win Big\u2019, this three-month promotion is designed to reward the existing users of ComBank Digital for making more frequent transactions through the bank\u2019s digital banking platform.\n\nThe first monthly draw, covering October, rewarded 20 lucky customers with an array of premium tech and lifestyle prizes, including Apple iPhone Duo, JBL Go 5 ultra-portable speakers, Dialog Air Fiber connections and Dialog TV connections.\n\nThe excitement continues with two monthly draws remaining, offering the ComBank Digital users further chances to win attractive tech prizes.\u00a0 The customers continuing to transact through the Digital Banking platform will be eligible for the November draw featuring a grand prize of a Samsung Galaxy Z Fold8 and the ultimate December draw, which will give away a brand-new iPhone 18.\n\nOpen to the existing ComBank Digital customers, the promotion rewards the customers who successfully complete a minimum of five eligible transactions during each promotional month."
