    "md5": "c6e041b81900d44080404cae0fb3e911",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1813,
    "chunk_text": "SriLankan reclaims APEX Best Entertainment in Central and Southern Asia title\n\nSriLankan Airlines Senior Manager Product Development Maria Sathasivam (left) and Ashan Dias Amaratunga (right) accept APEX Best Entertainment Award for Central/Southern Asia and APEX Four-Star Major Airline rating from APEX Chief Executive Officer Dr. Joe Leader at APEX Best Awards ceremony on November 19, 2026 during APEX FTE EXPO 2026 in Singapore\n\nSriLankan Airlines has reclaimed the APEX Best Entertainment in Central and Southern Asia title while retaining its APEX Four-Star Major Airline rating at the 2027 APEX FTE EXPO, held recently in Singapore.\n\nThe dual recognition reflects the airline\u2019s continued ability to deliver an onboard experience that the passengers themselves consider top-tier by global standards.\n\nBased on more than one million verified passenger votes through TripIt by Concur, the world\u2019s leading travel-organising app, the APEX Awards are regarded as among the most prestigious accolades in the global aviation industry.\n\nThe awards evaluate more than 600 airlines worldwide, recognising excellence across geographical regions and key aspects of the passenger experience, including seat comfort, cabin service, food and beverage, entertainment and Wi-Fi.\n\nSriLankan Airlines Senior Manager Product Development Maria Sathasivam stated, \u201cRecognition of this nature is particularly meaningful to us because it comes directly from our passengers and reflects the actual experiences of those who travel with us. It reaffirms the importance of continuously listening to our passengers and evolving our product. Moreover, retaining our Four-Star Major Airline rating for eight consecutive years is especially encouraging, as it speaks to our commitment to delivering a consistent passenger experience."
  },
