    "chunk_text": "The last two pillars make the first three bankable. They are where the ecosystem we have built at AquaKraft, and the Water Parliament, can make the greatest contribution. A complete ecosystem for water positivity\n\nOver the years, my colleagues and I have built an ecosystem that offers Sri Lanka a single chain, from the project on the ground to the verified result recorded for the world.\n\nAqVerium: proving and valuing the results. AqVerium is a digital water bank and exchange. It meters water outcomes at source, cross-checks them with satellite data, scores each project with a Water Sustainability Score, and records the results on a permissioned blockchain ledger, with independent assurance. Verified benefits can be certified as AquaKredits, with one AquaKredit equal to one cubic metre of verified water benefit. AquaKredits are issued only with national authorisation, priced locally, and confer no rights over a nation\u2019s water. They help direct corporate and blended finance to the projects that deliver.\n\nThe Water Parliament: setting the common language. Through its Unified Water Protocol and the Global Water Registry, the Water Parliament gives Sri Lanka\u2019s progress a common standard and a trusted international record. Aquas360 and the 5 i's: one framework, one method\n\nA mission needs a framework that every ministry, district and partner can follow. At AquaKraft we have built one: Aquas360 defines what must be delivered, and the 5 i's define how it is delivered, from the first survey to the verified result.\n\nAquas360: the full water cycle in one model. Each letter is a block of work, and together they cover every drop, from source to reuse:\n\nAccess: rainwater harvesting, groundwater and aquifer recharge, and the revival of tanks and ponds;\n\nUse & Reuse: circularity, water-use monitoring and efficiency, with treated wastewater returned to productive use;\n\nAudit & Accounting: metering, water audits and a Water Balance Sheet for every site;"
  },
