    "chunk_text": "Pilots funded by the private sector. In 2027, the first pilots in priority districts, funded by the private sector, so that the approach is proven on the ground with a measured baseline before public funds are committed at scale.\n\nMeasure verified impact with AquaKredits. By 2029, every result is metered, independently verified and certified as AquaKredits, one AquaKredit for each cubic metre of verified water benefit, and recorded in the Global Water Registry.\n\nAchieve water positivity by 2030. In 2030, Sri Lanka declares itself Water Positive, with every claim independently verified and publicly recorded. A nation that can lead again\n\nSri Lanka once showed the world how to honour every drop of water. Today, it has the chance to do so again, combining the wisdom of its ancient cascades with modern science, digital verification and a global coalition of partners.\n\nOur ecosystem brings the tools, and AqVerium brings the trusted finance. I bring my commitment, and the Water Parliament brings the people together. What remains is the most important ingredient of all: a nation\u2019s resolve.\n\nWater Positive by 2030 is not only a goal for Sri Lanka. It could become an example for the world.\n\nThe \u201cSri Lanka Water Positive by 2030\u201d mission is a proposal for the Government of Sri Lanka\u2019s consideration.\n\nThe writer is the Founder Chairman & CEO, AquaKraft Group Ventures, Founder, Water Parliament & AqVerium - World\u2019s 1st Digital Water Bank, Joint Secretary of IndiaNPIM - A Society under Ministry of Jal Shakti, Govt of India and Special Envoy - Water Supply & Sanitation Department, Govt. of Maharashtra, India"
