    "chunk_size_bytes": 1944,
    "chunk_text": "Islandwide Scientific strengthens leadership team to expand scientific and research solutions in Sri Lanka\n\nNew management appointments reinforce company\u2019s focus on service excellence, technical expertise and future growth\n\nIslandwide Scientific Ltd., a leading importer, distributor and indenting agent for scientific, analytical and laboratory instruments in Sri Lanka, is continuing to expand its product and service offerings for the country\u2019s science, research and industrial sectors under its newly appointed leadership team.\n\nEstablished in 1991, the company has built a strong presence in Sri Lanka\u2019s scientific instrumentation industry, serving universities, research institutions, Government laboratories, industrial quality control facilities and environmental monitoring agencies. Its strengthened leadership team will focus on building on this foundation, expanding access to advanced scientific technologies and enhancing the technical support and services available to customers.\n\nMangala Nanayakkara has been appointed Managing Director of Islandwide Scientific, bringing extensive financial and operational management experience to the role. A Fellow Member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Sri Lanka, she previously served for 20 years as Director of Finance and Operations at the company. She also brings strategic leadership experience gained as a former Executive Director of one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading business groups.\n\nCommenting on her appointment, Nanayakkara said, \u201cIslandwide Scientific has built a strong reputation through its technical expertise, international partnerships and commitment to customer service. Our priority is to continue strengthening these capabilities while responding to the changing needs of Sri Lanka\u2019s scientific and research community. We remain committed to providing our customers with reliable solutions and specialised technical support to advance their work.\u201d"
  },
