    "description": "UN-Government initiative strengthens social dialogue to build trust and prevent conflict",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/UN-Government-initiative-strengthens-social-dialogue-to-build-trust-and-prevent-conflict/56-800611",
