    "description": "After years of waiting, WhatsApp can finally send your messages on a timer",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/After-years-of-waiting-WhatsApp-can-finally-send-your-messages-on-a-timer/107-355751",
    "lang": "en",
