    "description": "Minneriya National Park earns over Rs. 10 mn daily from elephant tourism, court told",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Minneriya-National-Park-earns-over-Rs-10-mn-daily-from-elephant-tourism-court-told/108-355764",
    "lang": "en",
