    "description": "An uncertain ruling party and a confused opposition",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/An-uncertain-ruling-party-and-a-confused-opposition/172-355772",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
