    "chunk_text": "Talawakelle Tea Estates received the Environmental Sustainability Award, MAS Holdings \u2013 the Social Sustainability Award and Bank of Ceylon \u2013 the Economic Sustainability Award.\n\nThe Category Awards recognise organisations for their performance across specific areas of corporate responsibility.\n\nThe awards also recognised organisations leading sustainability practices within their respective sectors.\n\nThe 2026 sector champions are Talawakelle Tea Estates \u2013 Agriculture; Hayleys Fentons \u2013 Construction; Hemas Holdings \u2013 Diversified Holdings; Commercial Bank of Ceylon \u2013 Finance; Oxford College of Business \u2013 Knowledge Services; CBL Investments \u2013 Manufacturing; Singer (Sri Lanka) \u2013 Retail and South Asia Gateway Terminals under the sector \u2013 Other.\n\nFurther recognition went to CBL Investments, which received the Award for Resilient Practices, Haycarb, which received the Sustainability Innovation Award and Talawakelle Tea Estates, which won the Award for the Best Sustainability Report/Disclosure."
