    "chunk_text": "Sport remains a powerful platform through which Allianz brings people together while promoting confidence, safety, and opportunity. In 2026, Allianz played a key role in supporting the safe and successful delivery of the Olympic and Paralympic Winter Games Milano Cortina 2026 as the Worldwide Insurance Partner of the Olympic and Paralympic Movements. The event welcomed more than 5.4 million spectators and reached an estimated global audience of 2.6 billion viewers.\n\nThe latest Interbrand recognition underscores the strength of the Allianz brand as it continues to evolve alongside changing customer expectations and advances in technology. By consistently delivering on its promise of protection, confidence, and care, Allianz remains one of the world\u2019s most trusted and valuable financial services brands.\n\nThe Interbrand Best Global Brands Ranking is widely regarded as one of the world\u2019s leading assessments of brand value, evaluating brands based on financial performance, the influence of the brand on purchasing decisions, and overall brand strength."
