    "chunk_text": "Reflecting on the milestone, Chaminda Bandara, Chief Executive Officer of LifeServ, said: \u201cI have been with LifeServ since the day it began, and the trust we have earned over these 25 years is a responsibility I hold close. This legacy belongs to our people, partners and healthcare professionals. Together, we will continue bringing trusted care and quality healthcare solutions closer to patients across Sri Lanka.\u201d\n\nThe company also marked the anniversary with the launch of its revamped corporate website, www.lifeserv.lk, providing customers, healthcare professionals and organisations with easier access to information on its products, services and healthcare solutions, while reflecting its evolution over the past quarter century.\n\nLooking ahead, LifeServ said it aims to strengthen its specialist healthcare portfolios, expand island-wide availability, invest in latest healthcare solutions, and enhance customer service through data-driven planning.\n\nLifeServ\u2019s 25th anniversary is both a reflection of the experience built since 2001 and a step towards the future, with a continued commitment to making trusted healthcare solutions more accessible across Sri Lanka."
