    "chunk_size_bytes": 1566,
    "chunk_text": "\u201830BestBarsIndia\u2019 to launch \u2018Best Bars Sri Lanka\u2019 in early 2027\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s bar scene has been gaining recognition on the international stage, with a growing number of establishments earning global accolades and making their presence felt across Asia\u2019s cocktail landscape.\n\nBuilding on this momentum, 30BestBarsIndia; the annual ranking and awards platform founded by Vikram Achanta and Radhakrishnan Nair in 2019to recognise India\u2019s leading bars and the people behind them; is expanding its footprint to the island with the launch of Best Bars Sri Lanka.\n\nDedicated to recognising the country\u2019s leading bars and the people shaping its beverage industry, the inaugural ranking of Sri Lanka\u2019s Top bars will be unveiled at an awards evening in Colombo in early 2027, marking the first edition of the initiative. Over the past few years, Sri Lanka has developed a distinctive bar culture, bringing together its culinary heritage, indigenous ingredients, homegrown spirits and a new generation of hospitality talent. Bars such as Smoke & Bitters, Raa, Ropewalk and Uncle\u2019s have helped bring the country\u2019s cocktail scene to wider attention, with their approach to local flavours and contemporary drinks finding an audience beyond the island. Best Bars Sri Lanka aims to build on this growing recognition by creating a platform that celebrates the breadth of the country\u2019s bar landscape, from independent neighbourhood establishments to hotel and restaurant bars, while recognising the teams, bartenders and ideas that contribute to its evolution."
  },
