    "chunk_text": "Following the success of the Power Breakfast for Women, FACETS 2027 introduces The Gem Conversations \u2013 Stories That Sparkle, an intimate, invitation-only morning of gemstone stories, inspiring women and lively conversations about jewellery and creativity.\n\nFACETS 2027 Chairman Shezmin Mansoor added, \u201cFACETS continues to evolve as a world-class platform. These initiatives showcase Sri Lankan talent and strengthen our position as a premier jewellery destination.\u201d\n\nWith over 100 exhibitors expected and buyers attending from around the world, the exhibition will also offer opportunities for business, networking, education and international collaboration.\n\nPink sapphire earrings celebrates Sri Lanka\u2019s design excellence at FACETS 2027\n\nFACETS 2027 aims to build on artistry that transforms into jewellery"
