    "description": "Software takes centre stage as Sungrow wires AI into every layer of energy storage",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Software-takes-centre-stage-as-Sungrow-wires-AI-into-every-layer-of-energy-storage/273-355809",
    "lang": "en",
