    "chunk_text": "FCID questions Rohitha Rajapaksa over SupremeSAT deal\n\nColombo, Nov. 26 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Rohitha Rajapaksa, the youngest son of former President Mahinda Rajapaksa, appeared before the Financial Crimes Investigation Division (FCID) today (26) to provide a statement in connection with the ongoing investigation into the SupremeSAT satellite deal.\n\nHe arrived at the FCID this morning to record his statement as part of the investigation."
