    "chunk_text": "Heavy showers, severe lightning expected in several provinces\n\nColombo, Nov. 26 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0Heavy rainfall exceeding 100mm, accompanied by severe lightning, is expected in several parts of the country during the evening and night, the Department of Meteorology has warned.\n\nThe Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central, North-Central, North-Western and Uva provinces are likely to experience heavy showers exceeding 100mm in some areas.\n\nThe Department also warned of an increased likelihood of severe lightning associated with thundershowers at several locations.\n\nMeanwhile, sea areas could experience strong gusty winds reaching 60\u201370 kmph, along with very rough sea conditions temporarily during thundershowers."
