    "description": "Musk\u2019s plan to send a million SpaceX data satellites into space approved",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/Musks-plan-to-send-a-million-SpaceX-data-satellites-into-space-approved/107-355828",
    "lang": "en",
