    "chunk_text": "India-Sri Lanka discuss bilateral ties and regional developments\n\nIndian External Affairs Minister Dr. S. Jaishankar met Sri Lankan Foreign Minister Vijitha Herath yesterday for talks on strengthening bilateral relations and developments in the region, reaffirming New Delhi\u2019s focus on its neighbourhood engagement.\n\nIn a post on X following the meeting, Jaishankar described the discussions as positive and said he looked forward to continuing the engagement at the Indian Ocean Rim Association (IORA).\n\nHe also underscored India\u2019s \u2018Neighbourhood First\u2019 policy and \u2018Vision MAHASAGAR\u2019 initiative, reflecting the importance New Delhi places on regional cooperation and maritime engagement."
