    "description": "India is region\u2019s economic giant. Will Sri Lanka remain a neighbour or become a partner?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/India-is-region-s-economic-giant-Will-Sri-Lanka-remain-a-neighbour-or-become-a-partner/4-800664",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
