    "chunk_size_bytes": 747,
    "chunk_text": "13-year-old schoolgirl dies after falling from milk lorry\n\nColombo, Nov. 27 (Daily Mirror) -\u00a0A 13-year-old schoolgirl died after falling from a milk-collecting lorry while travelling home following a Christmas carol rehearsal in Norwood yesterday, police said.\n\nThe victim was identified as Wijekumar Harshani, a Grade 8 student of Norwood Tamil Maha Vidyalaya and a resident of Akkara 50 in the Norwood Venture Estate.\n\nShe had attended a Christmas carol rehearsal at her school and was returning home when she reportedly got onto the rear of a milk-collecting lorry.\n\nAt around 4.00 p.m., the girl fell from the moving vehicle near her home and sustained serious injuries.\n\nShe was rushed to Dickoya Base Hospital but died after being admitted."
