    "chunk_text": "\"While all involved will be encouraged to participate, there will be no compulsion to do so. All materials supplied will be treated as confidential unless otherwise stated by the participant and no sanctions will be retrospectively applied.\n\n\"This is an opportunity to provide their accounts in a safe environment and to provide the CA Board with relevant information including about the events of that tour and resultant investigation,\" CA chair David Boon said.\n\n\"We are acutely aware of the enormous toll the renewed focus on this tour eight years ago has had on those involved and their welfare remains our main priority.\n\n\"This forum is the best opportunity for people to speak and be heard, and for CA to listen and learn.\n\n\"Publishing the report in full is part of our commitment to transparency, and to be open with cricket fans about what we learn.\n\n\"It is also very important to understand that it will not seek to sanction or recriminate.\""
