    "chunk_text": "Founded in 1927, Gallagher is a global insurance brokerage, risk management and consulting services firm headquartered in the United States. It employs 73,000 people and operates in approximately 130 countries.\n\nGallagher Director Operations Malsha Jayamaha said the opening of the new office was a significant milestone for the company\u2019s Sri Lankan operations.\n\n\u201cSri Lanka has a strong pool of skilled, adaptable and capable professionals who bring tremendous value to global organisations. Our talent, commitment and ability to work across international markets make Sri Lanka an attractive destination, with significant potential for further growth.\n\n\u201cTo prospective talent, Gallagher offers an opportunity to grow, build meaningful careers and be part of a global organisation with an exciting future,\u201d she said."
