    "chunk_text": "In year-to-date 3Q 2026 (IASL 2026) SLICGL has strengthened its position in motor with its iconic Motor Plus brand as well and strengthened its non-motor position becoming no one in non-motor in the latest quarter 3Q.\n\nMoreover, the results compare favourably with those peers over the same period, even though the Cyclone Ditwah-related claims weighed on 2025. For individual policyholders and corporate clients, an \u2018AA-(lka)\u2019 rating signals a resilient position within Sri Lanka\u2019s general insurance sector.\n\nOverall, the milestone reaffirms SLICGL\u2019s commitment to safeguarding the policyholders, with financial stability for Sri Lankan businesses and individuals remaining a continued focus."
