    "description": "International Finance Corporation taps HSBC for rupee funding in Asia first",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/International-Finance-Corporation-taps-HSBC-for-rupee-funding-in-Asia-first/215-355887",
    "lang": "en",
